        "indexIds": {
          "Hollow Village": 0,
          "\"I'm sorry, it seems I forgot something, a blessing to be exact.\nLet me bestow it upon you.\"": 1,
          "\"The world itself is filled with hatred towards your existence.\\!\nIf your burden overwhelms you, please return to the orphanage\nand make an offering to the flame there.\"": 2,
          "\"...Though it is not a particularly effective method,\nso please make sure to use it carefully.\"": 3,
          "\"You can always return by touching the crystal.\nIf you wish to avoid troublesome battles, you may offer it.\"": 4,
          "\"...However, if you endure the ordeal and emerge victorious,\nfragments of their souls will be absorbed into your body.\"": 5,
          "\"At that time, return to the fire from which you were born,\npour the fragments of your victory, their very essence, the Souls.\nLet your strength grow far more formidable.\"": 6,
          "\"...And, well, lastly... before you go,\nthere's something I'd like to ask in advance...\"": 7,
          "\"...Carnal acts... that is to say, um, indecent things—\nare you interested in them?\"": 8,
          "Interested": 9,
          "Not interested": 10,
          "\"...Do you want to see them?\"": 11,
          "Yes": 12,
          "Return": 13,
          "\"...I see.\"": 14,
          "\"Um...! Please, try to keep it in moderation, okay?\"": 15,
          "\"...Are you truly not interested?\"": 16,
          "\"...Understood. Thank you.\"": 17,
          "\"...May your path lead you to its destined end.\"": 18
        },
