        "indexIds": {
          "★Cycle Process★": 0,
          "\"...Good morning.\"": 1,
          "\"Fufu... what do we have on our hands?\nEven though you are awake, you don't seem to understand anything.\nIsn't it usually the other way around?\"": 2,
          "\"Do I have to close your eyes for you as well?\\!\n...Yeah. It'd be nice if you could do it yourself one day.\nUntil then, I'll have to help you out.\"": 3,
          "\"Here, go back to sleep... your mission is still ongoing...\nNothing has ended, let alone even begun...\"": 4,
          "\"...Good luck.\nAnd show us the true end, okay?\"": 5,
          "\"...I guess, it's hopeless after all, huh?\"": 6,
          "\"But, you haven't given up yet, right?\nI guess you're still planning to keep going, huh?\"": 7,
          "\"...Please, don't push yourself too hard, your soul might break.\nI hope that doesn't happen.\"": 8,
          "\"...Did you understand anything this time around?\nI have no clue what you might be thinking.\"": 9,
          "\"...Fufu, just being able to play a role like this...\nI'm a lucky person, aren't I?\"": 10,
          "\"Make sure to never forget, okay?\nYou're loved by so many people...\"": 11,
          "\"...Are you feeling afraid, tired, anxious?\nI feel like you've somehow gained some hope, though.\"": 12,
          "\"...I can only help with waking you up and getting you to sleep,\nbut I wonder if there's anything else I can do for you...\"": 13,
          "\"...I have no other choice but to rely on you.\nThe fact that I can't do anything is so frustrating.\nI'm sorry, \\n[1]...\"": 14,
          "\"...Hey.\"": 15,
          "\"What if everything goes well?\nWhat if you manage to save the world from its end?\"": 16,
          "\"In that case, please remember that I'm always here...\"": 17,
          "\"...Then, surely, I will be able to live on in your heart.\"": 18,
          "\"...I love you.\"": 19,
          "\"My dear child...\"": 20,
          "\"...It's going to be lonely, isn't it?\"": 21,
          "\"I'm actually very happy for you,\nbut now that I think about it, this is just a very long farewell.\"": 22,
          "\"I feel just a little bit... lonely, without you sometimes.\"": 23,
          "\"...No, you have to keep going!\\! ...Take care.\"": 24,
          "周回で追加する変数": 25,
          "スイッチ・変数初期化": 26,
          "光バグ救済用": 27,
          "スクリプト": 28,
          "セルフスイッチ初期化": 29,
          "持ち越し不可アイテムの削除": 30,
          "周回時特殊処理": 31,
