        "indexIds": {
          "Cycle of Blasphemy": 0,
          "\\c[30]Beyond this point lies the Cycle of Blasphemy.\nUnder the principles granted by our mother,\nand her mother before her, the return of blasphmemy shall proceed.": 1,
          "\\c[30]Cycle of Blasphemy, Part One\n\\c[10]Within her return, records are not allowed.\\c[30]\nMoreover, unless defeated or willfully choosing to stop the\nreturn, there is no other way to escape from it.": 2,
          "\\c[30]Cycle of Blasphemy, Part Two\nWhen the return is interrupted due to defeat,\nthe tools expended in battle will be returned to your possession.\n\\c[10]However, if you emerge victorious, the tools used will be lost.": 3,
          "\\c[30]Cycle of Blasphemy, Part Three\nAt any given time, all enemies are equally strong,\nregardless of whether they carry sin or not.\nThe strength etched into the enemies will remain unchanged.": 4,
          "\\c[30]Cycle of Blasphemy, Part Four\nEven in the midst of battle, all equipment can be changed.": 5,
