        "indexIds": {
          "★Keikko HEV": 0,
          "I raped a girl.": 1,
          "\"A...ah...\"": 2,
          "I don't know what is dripping from this girl's face...\nAll I can tell is that this is just weird,\nand all I know is that she still has a body of a lovely girl.": 3,
          "That stuff is constantly dripping out of her empty eyes...\n...There's no need to worry.\nI will show you my love, just like how I would to anyone.\nYour face is still pretty cute, all things considered.": 4,
          "It seems like you aren't quite comfortable with this.\nThat's fine, the world is going to end soon.\nI want to enjoy your body before it happens.": 5,
          "Don't be afraid.\nI'm just going to give your body a little bit of comfort.\nSo, you see, there's no need to cry.\nI'm sure you're going to feel good...": 6,
          "No matter what I do, she will turn back to... this anyway.\nShe probably doesn't even know what I'm doing.\nLikely, she doesn't realize anything's wrong with her body either.": 7,
          "...I don't even know if she has any intelligence left.": 8,
          "Doesn't matter, sex is still enjoyable even if it's one-sided.\nEven if it's with something as weird as this.\nAt least it looks like a woman.": 9,
          "Despite of her ruined body she seems to be very tight.\nProbably because it's so small.": 10,
          "I thought it would be very cold inside of her,\nit feels strangely warm, somehow.\nHer body must be warming up because of sex, when I pull it out,\nit's clearly quite cold outside.": 11,
          "I can feel the temperature rising and lowering.\nWhen I push it in, it's warm, when I pull out, it's cold.\nI guess I am doing this because what I desire is warmth...": 12,
          "I wonder, if I had a daughter, would she have such a cute face,\nwould her body temperature be as high?\n...No, let's not imagine things like that here.\nOnly because nobody reacts to my presence can I do this.": 13,
          "I am having sex with this girl simply because I desire warmth.\nShe is so tight that it feels quite itchy, it's not bad though.\nIn fact, it tells you that this is a little girl's vagina,\nit feels even more exciting now...": 14,
          "The liquid coming out of her eyes is also quite warm.\nPerhaps this is why her body feels like that.\nThis liquid doesn't seem like something I need to be afraid of.\nIt's already too late to worry about it now anyway.": 15,
          "It's good that you're sitting with your back against the wall,\nit's quite easy to fuck your body in this position.\nIt's quite hard not to be aroused by the way she looks.": 16,
          "I don't care how roughed-up or broken she is.\nThis girl must have been broken for a long time to begin with.\nWhat kind of future is left for a girl in this state?\nEspecially this close to the end of world?": 17,
          "I'll just enjoy it.\nI am a being born only to see the end of this world.\nThe end is already certain, no matter how outrageous it is,\nthere will be nobody left in this world to blame me anyway!": 18,
          "It doesn't matter how rough I get with her.\nIt doesn't matter if I smash her with enough force to break her.\nEven if I push it in as far as I can and finish deep inside,\nthere's nothing wrong with it, nothing wrong at all!": 19,
          "Yes, she's a toy just for my pleasure!\nIf it breaks even more, so be it! It's already broken after all!": 20,
          "I will take pleasure in breaking you, little girl!\nI don't expect you to get pregnant!\nYou're only going to serve me as a hole that allows me to cum!": 21,
          "...Hah, haah!\nI'm so messed up...\nI think I might have really broken this one...": 22,
          "...Why are all these girls like this?": 23,
          "I wish I had been born into a normal world with this power.\nI wanted to experience the bodies of healthy, normal females!\nI wanted to enjoy raping women with ordinary lives...!": 24,
          "...Why the hell is this world like this?\nEverything is already broken beyond repair!\nRaping them doesn't even feel that good!\n": 25,
          "I will rape and kill all of these women!\nAfter all, ending their lives myself is much more fun!": 26,
          "What a shame...\nI thought I was special in this world,\nI'm no different than these broken people that can't be saved.": 27,
          "...No.\nIf I could give up everything, like you guys, and end my life,\nI'd be happier...": 28,
          "This is how ALL OF YOU got your happiness...\nThe pleasure I get from you only increases the madness within me.": 29,
          "...Please, for God's sake,\ndon't look at me with such a sad face.": 30
        },
