          "You... you... all of you...!\nNobody reacts and keeps muttering the same response to me...!\nThat's the best proof you can find...!!": 15,
          "...Don't you know? Rather than your repetitive actions,\nthe monsters roaming around out there are much more interesting!\nI'm sure their reactions will be more interesting than yours!": 16,
          "Yes, they are, those monsters are...\nthey're seriously trying to kill me...!\nSo why, why, why none of you!\nWhy won't you react to anything, unlike those monsters!!": 17,
