          "...Please!\nSay something...!!!": 20,
          "Ugh... Fetus... Fetus...!\nI'm sorry... I'm really, really sorry...!!": 21,
          "...\\!?\\!\n\n...Fetus?": 22,
          "...Why are you blushing so much? \\!\nFetus, why are you looking that way...? \\!\nHey... Fetus...\\! Why is your face so hot...? \\!\nYou're all red...": 23,
          "Are you too embarrassed to make eye contact with me...?\nIs that why you're looking away from me like this...?\nDo you understand me, Fetus...?\nIt's me, I'm right here you know...?\"": 24,
          "And your body, I used it without permission...\\!\nI also said really terrible things to you...": 25,
          "...Sorry, I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.\n\nYou didn't respond to anything, so I just...": 26,
          "...\\!.\\!\n\nYeah, well,...\\! Somehow...": 27,
          "I only realized halfway through...": 28,
          "...Please.\nLet me see that face again...": 29,
          "No, not like before... something more, a different face, please.\nFetus...": 30,
          "...Are you that embarrassed?\nOf course, if you're embarrassed, it's quite normal...": 31,
          "...No, the physical contact suddenly turned into this...\nIt was a strange story from the beginning...\nbesides, I've been using your body every time...": 32,
          "I should have taken a more step-by-step approach...\nThat was really my fault...\n...b-but. I don't know what to say, but...\nwhen I do this, I feel very satisfied...": 33,
          "Uh, if you can't move, give me some kind of a signal...\nyou just can't move your body, right?\nI guess you're still really humiliated...\nAhh, uhh... how did you move your eyes...?": 34,
          "Anyway, anything is fine, won't you agree?\nGive me a clear signal...!\nIf you're aware of me, then what?\nGive me a signal...!!": 35,
          "...Ah, sorry.\nI've reached my limit already...\nI'll tell you how I feel... I love you...!\nI love you, I love you so much...!!": 36,
          "Oh, Fetus... I'm going to cum!\nFetus, please, take it all in...!\nI don't care what you think now, I'm sorry...!\nIt feels so good...! I'm so happy...!!": 37,
          "─ Ahh! I'm going to cum, I'm going to cum!": 38,
          "─!\nOh, her eyes, her eyes...!\nShe looked away again...": 39,
          "─. \\!\n...\\! Haah... haah...\nWhew...": 40,
          "...! It's just like before, nothing has changed!!\n\n...What's going on?": 41,
          "Why won't it change...?!\nWait... it had changed, but...\nIn the end, it's still the same response...": 42,
          "...No.\nIt's only Fetus.!\nIt's only Fetus who... reacts at least a little!\nUnlike the others...": 43,
          "...Between her and the others, what makes her so different?": 44
        },
