        "indexIds": {
          "★リスHEV2": 0,
          "NW名前指定 Risu": 1,
          "\"...Ara.\nYou finally woke up.\"": 2,
          "\"Fufu, good morning...\nare you okay? Can you feel what's happening to you?\"": 3,
          "...Ah, ahh...": 4,
          "\"...H-mmm. I guess not. \\!\nWell, as long as I can get the... seeds out, I'm good.\nBut if I can, I'd like to have fun doing it...\"": 5,
          "...\\!\nW-What the... what is this...?\nWhy are you doing this...?": 6,
          "\"Fufu. Your consciousness has become clear. \\!\nI told you I would use your body...\"": 7,
          "Oh... I see, I didn't seem to understand it back then...\nI thought you were just teasing me...": 8,
          "\"Ara, It's quite rude to say that, you know?\nI'm going to use your cum to make a... child. \\!\nIt's such an honor, you know?　\nIt's my first time after all.\"": 9,
          "I have a lot of... questions but...\nAnyway, I have no reason to refuse I suppose. \\!\nIf you want to use me, use it as you wish...": 10,
          "\"Fufu... I'll take your word for it. \\!\nI would have even if you said no anyways...\nI would have still kept going until I got it all out.\"": 11,
          "-Woah! What the hell are you doing!\nWhat kind of hip movements are those...!?\nI thought this was your first time...!": 12,
          "\"Yes it is.\"": 13,
          "Oh... but it feels so, so good...\nit's hard to believe it's your first time doing this.": 14,
          "\"I stole it from everyone.\nMemories, faces, shapes, life experiences of many people...\nwith the memories of people I stole, I can do something like this.\nFufu. Isn't it amazing?\"": 15,
          "...\nYou can't honestly be happy about it...": 16,
          "\"Why don't you just enjoy the moment?\nEverything will end soon, I can't do anything about it anyways.\nI thought you would enjoy it right before the end.\"": 17,
          "...Ah, I guess it's almost over at this point.": 18,
          "\"Ending the world is someone else's problem.\\!\nBy the time you pyuu~ and shoot it all outside,\neverything will end.\"": 19,
          "...Is it really that close...?": 20,
          "\"That's right.\"": 21,
          "... \\!\nI'm just really surprised I can have a normal conversation with you.": 22,
          "\"Hee, I wonder why that is.\"": 23,
          "...This whole world was so strange.\nWhoever I talked to just kept repeating the same things...\neveryone I met just kept muttering the same words endlessly...": 24,
          "But I can talk to you... \\!\nWho the hell are you...?": 25,
          "\"...From my point of view.\nI wonder who you are more.\"": 26,
          "Ah, right...\ndo you know what kind of being I am...?": 27,
          "\"...Come on! Of course not! \\!\nBut I guess I know who sent you here.\"": 28,
          "...Could you please tell me?": 29,
          "\"...Gwirionedd.\\!\nThat person probably did something in her \"Dream\".\nAnd so, you were born because of it.\"": 30,
          "So... that person...\nshe gave me a mission and released me, into this world...": 31,
          "\"...What mission was it?\"": 32,
          "...To see the end of the world.\nThat was... my mission.": 33,
          "\"...To see the end of the world.\nAt least you could've tried to do something about it, you know.\nI don't think she would release you to see something like that.\"": 34,
          "...But.\nThat was my mission, I was told that very clearly.": 35,
          "\"If that's true, then the thing Gwirionedd was doing...\nyou witnessing the world's end doesn't mean it will truly end.\nThink of it as an implication.\"": 36,
          "The world... will not end...?": 37,
          "\"It's not going to end. \\!\nOnce nothing is left, it will just continue existing.\nThough, you won't be able to see that for yourself.\"": 38,
          "\"But, I still don't understand the meaning behind your mission.\nHowever, if Gwirionedd gave you this mission,\nit must be very important.\"": 39,
          "...Thank you. \\!\nI feel like my head is starting to clear,\nand I know what I should do.": 40,
          "\"I enjoyed it too... \\!\n─By the way, it's about time,\nI'm going for the finishing blow, if you don't mind.\"": 41,
          "─Hey, wait a minute...!\nI need to ask you a question, please tell me...!\\!\nWho is this Gwirionedd person we were talking about...!?": 42,
          "\"Okay, I'll tell you.\\!\nGwirionedd was...\\! Our mother.\"": 43,
          "\"Hora, what do you think...!\\!\nI could tell you were freaking out from the beginning...\nbut isn't it about time for you to cum?\nWouldn't you feel good if you came? Could you please cum now?\"": 44,
          "Ggh... ahhh...!\nShe's trying to squeeze me dry...!": 45,
          "\"Fufu.\nYou looked so worried just a moment ago,\nit's hard to believe you've changed so quickly...\nthis is quite amazing and stupid at the same time...\"": 46,
          "\"But it feels good, doesn't it?\nIf that's the case, it can't be helped right?\nI want to have a child too, so here... let it allll out~.\n": 47,
          "Ahh, I-I'm cumming...!!\nIt's all coming out...!!!": 48,
          "Hah...!\nHuff...": 49,
          "\"Aah... you came so much.\nI can feel it all inside of me...\"": 50,
          "\"Hora... look?\nYou're also making me cum like this...♡\\!\nI can feel a new 'Fetus' inside of me...♡\"": 51,
          "....\\!\nI know this is not the best moment but...\ncan you even get pregnant...?\nIt's the end of the world...": 52,
          "\"...I actually don't know, that's...\nBut wouldn't it be wonderful if you could really impregnate me...?\"": 53,
          "\"That's why—\"": 54,
          "─Ggh!\nHey, oi oi! What the hell...!!": 55,
          "\"I will make sure to squeeze everything out...♪\"": 56,
          "Shit! She's too gooooooood!": 57,
          "\"I'm gonna keep going... till the end.\"": 58,
          "\"Won't you just stay with me here, forever...?\"": 59,
          "\"Forever... fufu.\"": 60,
          "\"Yes, forever...\"": 61,
          "\"Forever...\"": 62,
          "『Her World』": 63
        },
        "indexIsBuilt": false,
        "progress": {
          "translated": 63,
          "length": 64,
          "percent": 98.4375
        },
        "cellInfo": []
      },
