        "indexIds": {
          "★F Yun HEV": 0,
          "NW名前指定 Yun": 1,
          "\"...Hmmmm?　What's wrong? \\!\n...What are you talking about, onii-san? I can't do that.\nYou know, this village can't sustain itself without my help.\nIf I have a baby now, this place would be in a lot of trouble.\"": 2,
          "\"Onii-san is in a pretty good spot though, isn't he?\nYou can enjoy spending time with other people if you want...\nWell... onii-san, it's a really strange situation we have here,\nI'm not sure what to say when you pull out your penis like that.\"": 3,
          "\"I mean, come on, why do you want to do it this much?\\!\nLying down and getting your dick stepped on...\nIs this what a hero who saved the world should look like?\"": 4,
          "\"I just thought I'd tease you a little,\nwhat can i say, I'm... disillusioned? Hmmm, I wonder what it is...\\!\nI guess there are people who are like this~...\nand one of them is the onii-san I have right here...\"": 5,
          "\"...Eh. What? You want me to continue?\\!\n...You were enjoying it?\nHonestly, I just want to stop now, but...\"": 6,
          "\"Come on onii-san, let's keep our dignities at least...\nDoing this makes me feel quite disgusted.\"": 7,
          "Please continue": 8,
          "You're right": 9,
          "\"...Whoa. \\!\nDid you hear me saying I wanted to stop?\\!\n...I guess onii-san listens and says things like that now.\nI kinda wanted to make you beg for it... disappointing.\"": 10,
          "\"Onii-san, do you even realize what you're asking me to do? \\!\nI don't know how it feels to be... stepped on, but...\nI don't really understand why you'd want me to continue either.\nAre you really trying to cum like this...?\\! You're so stupid...\"": 11,
          "\"Yeah. Quick, put them back on and stand up.\\!\nI'm sorry for teasing you, but you're my onii-san.\\!\nWhy are you making a face like you were actually feeling good...?\nPlease try to act like a hero at least.\"": 12,
          "\"But... why is your dick still twitching like that over there?\\!\n\nSigh...\"": 13,
          "\"...Fuuh.\nAhh, okay? If onii-san wants it this badly, I'll do it I suppose.\\!\nBut onii-san, you're just going to waste your seed like this.\nYou better realize that.\"": 14,
          "\"Wow, you're really breathing hard...\\!\nYes, yes, I'm going to rub your cock, so let's calm down...\\!\nFuu... you look like a complete idiot right now.\"": 15,
          "\"Yes, onii-san, I'll do it for you~...\nwhat's this slimy stuff, wow...\\!\nDoes it come out when you get excited? I see, it does~\nOnii-san is really serious about this, ahahaha!\"": 16,
          "\"I don't really know what I'm being made to do.\nBut onii-san seems to be excited and really enjoy it...!\n...Can you at least try to act a bit more... normal.\nI think I'm watching something I wouldn't believe otherwise...\"": 17,
          "\"...Onii-san you are somehow getting even more worthless.\\!\nI'm not going to tell anyone though, but...\nshouldn't you at least be asking the other girls to do this?\\!\nI'm sure you don't want to be known as the perverted hero.\"": 18,
          "\"Ahh yes, yes, twitch, twitch. Yeah, yeah, it feels good.\nIt feels so good to be rubbed by my foot.\\!\nRemember, the better you feel the more disappointed I am, onii-san.\nEhh, you don't seem to care about anything right now I guess.\"": 19,
          "\"Still, isn't that too much coming out of that thing...?\nIt's been overflowing for a while now... wow, this is disgusting.\\!\nThis was the first thing that came to your mind onii-san...?\\!\nNo...? I'm still surprised how calmly you asked for it, but now...\"": 20,
          "\"You know what, don't ask the other girls for this.\nI don't want you addicted to this kind of thing, okay?\nWell, it's okay if it's just me... should we do this again later?\n...Uwaah~ onii-san... you're helpless...\"": 21,
          "\"Hmmm, if you're willing to help me out with some things,\nafter you're done at the end of the day, maybe?\\!\n...No no, never mind, there's no way I'll do it.\nI don't want to keep a pervert like you around onii-san.\"": 22,
          "\"Fufu, Hero of the world is willing to work just to be stepped on.\nIt's a really funny idea, no matter how you think about it.\\!\nNo no, I won't let onii-san become such a helpless person.\nWhy don't you stop this awful act of yours now, onii-san.\"": 23,
          "\"...I still don't know what is going on in that head of yours.\nIf you have some sort of a foot fetish, ask another girl.\\!\nI don't want to see the hero who saved the world like this, but\nI don't care what happens to a pervert like you at this point.\"": 24,
          "\"...Eh, come to think of it, onii-san.\nIf you wanted this,\nshouldn't you have just asked your lover to do it?\\!\n...Onii-san, what are you trying to achieve here?\"": 25,
          "\"Pff...! Ahahaha!\nOnii-san～～！You're the worst!!\\!\nHow can you make such a pleased face like that?\n...Pfff! I see I see~!\"": 26,
          "\"That's right~! It feels so good, doesn't it~?\nI know, I know. I can understand that you feel good!\\!\nIt feels so good that you had to beg for it, right?\nIf it feels so good, onii-san can't help it~!\"": 27,
          "\"By the way onii-san, where is your girlfriend right now?\\!\n...Hehe.\nYou leaving your lover just to have some other girl do it for you?\nYou felt so good that you begged her for her feet~...\"": 28,
          "\"Hey, let's have sex after this!\\!\n...Okay?\\! Just bring your girlfriend to the front of the store!\\!\nI'll make you wait, then I will fuck you myself...!\nYou'll feel happy just because you can have sex with me, right!?\"": 29,
