        "tags": [],
        "extension": ".rvdata2",
        "dirname": "/data",
        "parameters": [],
        "indexIds": {
          "Fragmented Truth": 0,
          "By pouring this into fire, you can ignore the entities of the world.\r\nFragmented Truth. There is a reason for its division.": 1,
          "400～　：弱体付与系\r\n500～　：強化系\r\n700～　：雑多なもの\r\n900～　：鍛冶素材\r\n1000～　：記憶、特技系\r\n1100～　：記憶、魔法系\r\n1200～　：ソウル系\r\n1300～　：ボスソウル系\r\n1500～　：雫\r\n1550～　：特殊な能力UP系\r\n2000～　：光\r\n\r\n<2>": 2,
          "Fragmented Fire": 3,
          "Discarding the fire allows you to return to your original state.\r\nThe other half of the truth. The final daughter awaits you.": 4,
          "<3>": 5,
          "Call": 6,
          "Restores 50% HP. Lost Calls can be retrieved by touching a crystal.\r\nIf you listen closely, you can hear a soothing voice.": 7,
          "<1>": 8,
          "Cry": 9,
          "Restores 50% MP. Lost Cries can be retrieved by touching a crystal.\r\nThe mournful cry of the dead resonates with a rare power.": 10,
          "<2>": 11,
          "True Call": 12,
          "Restores 100% HP.\r\n\\c[23]\"Good morning.\"": 13,
          "Red Doll": 14,
          "Restores 30% HP.\r\nAn ordinary doll, you can see the traces of care that went into it.": 15,
          "<7>": 16,
          "Antidote Flask": 17,
          "Cures Poison. Prevents Poison for a short time and grants RES.\r\nA must-have for those venturing beneath the Sky of Blue Plague.": 18,
          "<8>": 19,
          "Dream Key": 20,
          "Consumes the item to unlock sealed doors.\r\nMiracle from Dreamstaff Karna. Its crafting method remains a secret.": 21,
          "<6>": 22,
          "Fading Soul": 23,
          "Grants 50S upon use.": 24,
          "<500>": 25,
          "Blacksmith's Notes": 26,
          "Used for weapon enhancement. Required for upgrades from +1 to +3.\r\nWith a forge, you can borrow its wisdom to forge stronger weapons.": 27,
          "<900>": 28,
          "<1200>": 29,
          "Soul of the Hollow": 30,
          "Grants 100S upon use.": 31,
          "<1201>": 32,
          "Her Remnant": 33,
          "Returns the user to the last visited crystal.\r\n\\c[26]She is watching.": 34,
          "Throwing Knife": 35,
          "Deals speed-based damage to a single enemy. (No turn cost)\r\nBack in the day, there were people who clung to very fragile hopes.": 36,
          "[hzm]ターン消費無し:99\r\n<追加ダメージタグ:狂怖>\r\n<追加ダメージタグ:ネルス>": 37,
          "Ember": 38,
          "Imbues your weapon with fire, increasing ATK and MAG by 10%.\r\nMagic that brought fire was feared, only these miracles remained.": 39,
          "Glacite": 40,
          "Imbues your weapon with ice, increasing ATK and MAG by 10%.\r\nMiracle that tells the story of the land filled with terrifying ice.": 41,
          "Lightning": 42,
          "Imbues your weapon with lightning, increasing ATK and MAG by 20%.\r\nEven God's wrath has been reduced to a single miracle.": 43,
          "Blight": 44,
          "Imbues your weapon with blight, increasing ATK and MAG by 10%\r\nThe dark plague that corrupts even the miracles.": 45,
          "Fleeting Flame": 46,
          "Temporarily makes you undetectable to enemies.\r\nGazing into the fire threatens to consume your consciousness.": 47,
          "ステルス:200": 48,
          "Drop of Vitality": 49,
          "Increases MaxHP by 20.\r\nA teardrop spilled from the depths of a dark dream.": 50,
          "<1500>": 51,
          "Drop of Astrality": 52,
          "Increases MaxMP by 10 when used.\r\nA teardrop that fell from the stars.": 53,
          "<1501>": 54,
          "Drop of Might": 55,
          "Increases ATK by 2 when used.\r\nA horrifying teardrop that spilled from the red sky.": 56,
          "<1502>": 57,
          "Drop of Protection": 58,
          "Increases DEF by 2 when used.\r\nA teardrop from a dying comrade of the Sword of Dreams.": 59,
          "<1503>": 60,
          "Drop of Arcana": 61,
          "Increases MAG by 2 when used.\r\nA teardrop shed by the Dreamstaff for her beloved daughter.": 62,
          "<1504>": 63,
          "Drop of Umbra": 64,
          "Increases MDF by 2 when used.\r\nA cursed drop that seeped from dark corruption.": 65,
          "<1505>": 66,
          "Drop of Agility": 67,
          "Increases SPD by 2 when used.\r\nA teardrop shed by those resolved to resist until the end.": 68,
          "<1506>": 69,
          "Drop of Fortune": 70,
          "Increases LCK by 2 when used.\r\nA teardrop left behind by the Eye of Truth.": 71,
          "<1507>": 72,
          "Healing Elixir": 73,
          "A medicine said to heal physical wounds.\r\nI don't feel any effects whether I apply it or drink it.": 74,
          "True Cry": 75,
          "Restores 100% MP.\r\n\\c[26]\"I'm sorry... everyone, I'm so sorry...!\"": 76,
          "<4>": 77,
          "Blacksmith's Guide": 78,
          "Used for weapon enhancement. Required for upgrades from +4 to +6.\r\nWith a forge, you can borrow its wisdom to forge stronger weapons.": 79,
          "<901>": 80,
          "Blacksmith's Tome": 81,
          "Used for weapon enhancement. Required for upgrades from +7 to +9.\r\nWith a forge, you can borrow its wisdom to forge stronger weapons.": 82,
          "<902>": 83,
          "Blacksmith's Wisdom": 84,
          "Used for weapon enhancement. Required for upgrading weapons to +10.\r\nWith a forge, you can borrow its wisdom to forge stronger weapons.": 85,
          "<903>": 86,
          "Blacksmith's Dream": 87,
          "Used for weapon enhancement. Required for upgrading special weapons.\r\nWith a forge, you can borrow the dream to forge stronger weapons.": 88,
          "<904>": 89,
          "Nursery Rhyme Fragment": 90,
          "Increases TP by 30.\r\n\\c[23]\"When we sing together, our hearts become one.\"": 91,
          "<6>\r\n\r\nSparkling in the night sky,\r\nOur beloved stars above.\r\nEach one unique, yet all the same,\r\nBeautiful in their own way.\r\nStanding together,\r\nHolding hands tightly,\r\nSomeday, surely,\r\nWe'll smile as one.\r\nSuch a day will come,\r\nSo don't shed tears until the end.\r\nShining brightly,\r\nOur beloved stars.\r\nOne day, surely, with a smile,\r\nAh, it will come true.": 92,
          "Soul of a Warrior": 93,
          "Grants 300S upon use.": 94,
          "<1202>": 95,
          "Memory【Miraculous Light】": 96,
          "Learn the Magic 【Miraculous Light】 ": 97,
          "<1100>": 98,
          "Soul of a Runaway": 99,
          "Grants 2000S upon use. Or perhaps...\r\nThough it's rotting and cracked, it still radiates an intense heat.": 100,
          "<1300>": 101,
          "Eye": 102,
          "A dry eye.": 103,
          "<700>": 104,
          "Acid Vial": 105,
          "Lowers the DEF of the enemy. (No turn cost, Once per turn)\r\nThis substance melts and sears everything it touches.": 106,
          "<403>\r\n[hzm]ターン消費無し:1\r\n<追加ダメージタグ:狂怖>": 107,
          "Blue Doll": 108,
          "Restores 30% MP.\r\nAn ordinary doll, you can see the traces of care that went into it.": 109,
          "Memory【Oath of Loyalty】": 110,
          "Learn the Skill【Oath of Loyalty】": 111,
          "<1000>": 112,
          "Shield Soul": 113,
          "Grants 2000S upon use. Or perhaps...\r\nIt could be mistaken for dust, however, its shape is still visible.": 114,
          "<1301>": 115,
          "Distant Night Grains": 116,
          "Used to shape a special soul by offering it to the distortion.\r\nThe star from that night still remembers the dream of that soul.": 117,
          "<999>": 118,
          "Debug Bear": 119,
          "A lovely bear that performs movements to process map updates.\r\nHowever, be cautious, as self-switch might cause strange behavior.": 120,
          "Wind Cloak": 121,
          "Temporarily increases SPD. (No turn cost, Once per turn)\r\nA Miracle from a girl that soared the skies with her Great Hawk.": 122,
