          "Nursery Rhyme Melody": 186,
          "Increases TP by 10. (No turn cost)\r\n\\c[23]\"As loud as you can, so that your voice can reach the stars...!\"": 187,
          "<6>\r\n[hzm]ターン消費無し:99\r\nNight sky glittering,\r\nEveryone's little stars,\r\nScattered and apart, but\r\nAll equally beautiful, aren't they?\r\nLined up together,\r\nHolding hands tightly,\r\nSurely one day, yes,\r\nWith the same smile,\r\nLaughing together, that day will come.\r\nUntil then, no tears to show.\r\nRadiantly shining,\r\nEveryone's little stars.\r\nSomeday, certainly, with a smile,\r\nOh, let it come true.": 188,
