        "indexIds": {
          "3": 139,
          "Gwirionedd Orphanage": 0,
          "<色調 51, 0, 20, 0>\r\n<マップ名Orphanage >": 1,
          "Knight": 2,
          "\\C[10]The Figure of a Noble One\n\\c[0]The form of knights, who valued loyalty above all.\nHas higher base stats.\nRemembers the powerful special skill \"Strong Attack\".": 3,
          "Do you want to take this appearance?": 4,
          "Yes": 5,
          "No": 6,
          "Spirit/Right": 7,
          "The fire stands still...": 8,
          "\\c[1]Pour a fragment of truth": 9,
          "Leave": 10,
          "Spirit/Left": 11,
          "Raise Level": 12,
          "\\c[18]Raise Level（Blood Ritual）　if(s[998])": 13,
          "Since you've reached max level, no more souls can be poured.": 14,
          "Specify the amount of souls to be poured into the fire.": 15,
          "I don't have enough souls...": 16,
          "In the Blood Ritual, you can convert 10000 S to 1 Level.\n\nSpecify the amount of souls to be poured into the fire.": 17,
          "EV007": 18,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 19,
          "\"Please, tell me your name.\"": 20,
          "\"...Eh?\"": 21,
          "\"...Risu?\"": 22,
          "\"Even if that is indeed your name, I ask you not to claim it.\nMy question doesn't define your true identity.\nPlease, choose another name.\"": 23,
          "\"...\"": 24,
          "\"...Who are you? Are you trying to play with my feelings?\nOr is it really the Dial itself...?\"": 25,
          "\"...We don't have much time left. We have to find another soul.\nOtherwise, what's the point of me being here...\"": 26,
          "\\n[1], is this your final choice?": 27,
          "\"...An interesting choice indeed.\"": 28,
          "\"Looks just like how you want it to, right?\"": 29,
          "\"Good morning.\nYou have been chosen as the messenger to watch the\nend of the world.\"": 30,
          "\"This world will soon come to an end.\nHow and why will the world perish?\nI want you to find out.\"": 31,
          "\"...But in order to accomplish this, you need a body.\nIf you're just a soul, surely,\nyou won't even be able to see dreams.\"": 32,
          "\"So please, choose the appearance you'll receive.\"": 33,
          "\"...Wonderful.\"": 34,
          "\"Then now, I will open the entrance to the world.\"": 35,
          "\"Thank you very much, \\n[1].\nStep forward into an ending world, and kindly observe its elegy.\"": 36,
          "\"...I recognize your power.\nThe fate of the world may differ...\nDepending on your actions things may change...\nYes, I have high hopes for you.\"": 37,
          "EV008": 38,
          "It's closed by some force...": 39,
          "Mage": 40,
          "\\c[10]The Figure of a Wise One\n\\c[0]The form of sages who sought truth through magic.\nBasic stats are low, but magic-related attributes are high.\nRemembers the spell, \"Soul Fire\".": 41,
          "There's a strong odor of rot coming from the crystal...": 42,
          "Dark One": 43,
          "\\c[10]The Figure of a Dark One\n\\c[0]The form of one who fell into darkness.\nInitial stats are low, but with better growth.\nHas mastered the powerful technique, \"Nightshroud Eclipse\".": 44,
          "The crystal stands in the dark...": 45,
          "Bandit": 46,
          "\\c[10]The Figure of a Swift One\n\\c[0]The form of one who resisted fate until the very end.\nHas exceptionally high speed, with a high critical hit rate.\nMaster of the spell \"Fatal Strike\", which instantly kills the enemy.": 47,
          "Rage is emanating from the crystal...": 48,
          "EV010": 49,
          "EV011": 50,
          "EV012": 51,
          "\\v[300] souls have been released.": 52,
          "EV013": 53,
          "EV014": 54,
          "Would you like to offer a prayer?": 55,
          "EV015": 56,
          "\"Hey.\"": 57,
          "「...\\.\\.繧?≠縲」": 58,
          "\"All along, I've been watching you.\"": 59,
          "「縺壹▲縺ｨ縲∝菅縺ｮ縺薙→繧定ｦ九＆縺帙※繧ゅｉ縺｣縺ｦ縺?◆繧医?」": 60,
          "\"Don't you want to admit this is how it ends? Hmm, then\nstart all over from scratch and see what you can do about it.\nEven so, you have a weird look on your face.": 61,
          "「縺薙ｓ縺ｪ邨先忰縺ｯ隱阪ａ縺溘￥縺ｪ縺?°縺?ｼ\n?代°繧牙?縺ｦ繧偵ｄ繧顔峩縺励?√←縺?↓縺九〒縺阪↑縺?°窶ｦ窶ｦ\n縺昴≧諤昴▲縺ｦ繧九??｡斐ｒ縺励※縺?ｋ縺ｭ縲」": 62,
          "\"But you know, \nwhat you've seen so far,\nis the future of the world.\nYou've just experienced it firsthand.\"": 63,
          "「縺ｧ縺阪ｋ繧医?\n蜷帙′莉翫∪縺ｧ隕九※縺阪◆繧ゅ?縺ｯ縲\n蜈ｨ縺ｦ荳也阜縺瑚ｾｿ繧区悴譚･縺ｪ繧薙□縺九ｉ縺輔?\n蜷帙?縺昴ｌ繧偵?∬ｌ霄ｫ繧帝?壹＠縲∽ｽ馴ｨ薙＠縺溘↓驕弱℃縺ｪ縺??」": 64,
          "\"...No, not really.\nWhat you experienced is a just some kind of reality.\nBut, this is still a dream, not reality.\nIn other words, once you wake up it's over.\"": 65,
          "「窶ｦ窶ｦ縺?ｄ縲√◎縺?〒繧ゅ↑縺?°縲\n遒ｺ縺九↓蜷帙′菴馴ｨ薙＠縺溘ｂ縺ｮ縺ｯ縲∽ｸ?遞ｮ縺ｮ迴ｾ螳溘°縲\n縺代ｌ縺ｩ縺ｭ縲√％繧後?螟｢縺ｧ縺ゅ▲縺ｦ迴ｾ螳溘§繧?↑縺??\n縺､縺ｾ繧翫?蜷帙ｈ縲∽ｸ?蠎ｦ逶ｮ隕壹ａ繧後?濶ｯ縺??縺輔?」": 66,
          "\"But you, my dear, \ndon't seem to notice that at all.\nYou can start over on your own!\nYou are still in a deep sleep!\"": 67,
          "「縺励°縺怜▼豌励↑蜷帙?縺昴?莠九↓蜈ｨ縺上?\n蠕ｮ蝪ｵ縺吶ｉ繧よｰ嶺ｻ倥￥讒伜ｭ舌′縺ｪ縺?ｼ\n蜷幄?霄ｫ縺ｧ繧?ｊ逶ｴ縺帙ｋ縺ｨ縺?≧縺ｮ縺ｫ縲\n蜷帙?縺ｾ縺?縲∵ｷｱ縺?悛繧翫↓關ｽ縺｡縺溘∪縺ｾ縺??」": 68,
          "\"...Oh. You don't understand my words.\nI'm a little sad.\nBut don't worry, your soul is listening.\nHora, let me help you up a little.\"": 69,
          "「窶ｦ窶ｦ縺ゅ≠縲ょ?縺九ｉ縺ｪ縺?ｓ縺?縲√?繧ｯ縺ｮ險?闡峨′縲\n縺｡繧?▲縺ｴ繧翫?∝ｯゅ＠縺??縲\n縺ｧ繧ょ､ｧ荳亥､ｫ縲∝菅縺ｮ鬲ゅ?閨槭＞縺ｦ縺?ｋ縲\n縺ｻ繧峨?√?繧ｯ縺悟ｰ代＠縲∬ｵｷ縺薙☆謇倶ｼ昴＞繧偵＠縺ｦ縺ゅ£繧九?」": 70,
          "Start the next cycle": 71,
          "...Seriously?\nShould I give my soul to this person...?": 72,
          "Surrender Yourself": 73,
          "Reconsider": 74,
          "やあ。": 75,
          "ずっと、君のことを見させてもらっていたよ。": 76,
          "こんな結末は認めたくないかい？\n１から全てをやり直し、どうにかできないか……\nそう思ってる、顔をしているね。": 77,
          "できるよ。\n君が今まで見てきたものは、\n全て世界が辿る未来なんだからさ。\n君はそれを、肌身を通し、体験したに過ぎない。": 78,
          "……いや、そうでもないか。\n確かに君が体験したものは、一種の現実か。\nけれどね、これはやはり夢であって現実じゃない。\nつまりは君よ、一度目覚めれば良いのさ。": 79,
          "しかし健気な君はその事に全く、\n微塵すらも気付く様子がない！\n君自身でやり直せるというのに、\n君はまだ、深い眠りに落ちたままだ！": 80,
          "……ああ。分からないんだ、ボクの言葉が。\nちょっぴり、寂しいね。\nでも大丈夫、君の魂は聞いている。\nほら、ボクが少し、起こす手伝いをしてあげる。": 81,
          "EV016": 82,
          "A hazy voice echoes in my head...": 83,
          "...What could they be saying?": 84,
          "...It's probably no big deal.": 85,
          "EV017": 86,
          "\"Ah... \\n[1].\"": 87,
          "\"...That was quick, huh?\"": 88,
          "\"...Or maybe too late?\"": 89,
          "\"Ah, ahahaha...\"": 90,
          "\"I don't even know where to begin...\"": 91,
          "\"...I've been dead for a long time.\"": 92,
          "\"...I keep dying, coming back to life.\"": 93,
          "\"...And every time I come back to life,\\!\nI have a long journey with a partner.\"": 94,
          "\"...\\n[1].\\!\nMy partner always introduces themselves like so!\nBut they never seems to remember me!\nTheir face, their appearance, always different...\"": 95,
          "\"...\\n[1].\nI remember everything now.\"": 96,
          "\"...What happened to me, what happened to us,\nand what happened to the world...\"": 97,
          "\"And that's when...\nI understood what I had to do.\"": 98,
          "\"...\\n[1].\nI'm going to meet Risu.\"": 99,
          "\"I wonder...\nIf we've already had this talk before...?\"": 100,
          "\"I don't know, but...\nI'm sure I must have told you this somewhere, right?\"": 101,
          "\"...I've always felt empty.\"": 102,
          "\"My memory is still missing in many ways, but...\nIt's different from that... There's an empty hole,\nI've always felt like there was a hole in my memory...\"": 103,
          "\"...We need to talk to Risu.\"": 104,
          "\"...I'm.\nThe truth is, I'm already dead.\"": 105,
          "\"...I died. A long, long time ago!\nAnd since then, over and over...\nI'd find myself alive... and I'd find myself dead.\"": 106,
          "\"Even now, things are still unclear.\nI remember inviting you here, but...\nA lot of things have slipped away...\nBut I do remember defeating the Four Ethereals...\"": 107,
          "\"...I wonder, what the hell am I?\nHahaha...\"": 108,
          "\"...So, every time I live again, I find a partner.\"": 109,
          "\"I travel with that person.\nWe fight together... over and over.\nTo save the world...\"": 110,
          "\"...\\n[1].\\!\nThis person always, always called themselves that...\nthey always told me they were my partner...\"": 111,
          "\"...We're both dead... huh? Fufu!\n─Umm, I'm not sure if \\n[1] can really die though.\nI don't really understand that myself.\"": 112,
          "\"...I've always been like this, looking the same.\nBut \\n[1] is...\nYou are different every time I see you...\"": 113,
          "\"...Nee, \\n[1]!\nI really think, now, we could actually...\nsave the world.\"": 114,
          "\"We can't pass the distortion in the underground lake,\nand I'm sure \\c[18]Dial's\\c[0] true power is lying dormant.\"": 115,
          "\"...But we're prevented from entering the distortion,\nthere's some kind of power...!\nAnd I think I recognize whose power it is.\"": 116,
          "\"...Risu, Pale Eternity.\"": 117,
          "\"We should leave the orphanage.\nIf we keep going, we'll reach its garden.\"": 118,
          "\"I don't understand why, but I know...\nShe will be there.\"": 119,
          "\"...I'll go ahead and wait for you.\"": 120,
          "\"...\\n[1].\"": 121,
          "\"...Is it okay if I tell you something strange?\"": 122,
          "\"...I died a long time ago.\nWhether I was killed or not, I'm not sure, but at the least...\nIt's amusing that I'm alive in this reality now.": 123,
          "\"And then, before I knew it, I came back to life...\nOnly to be killed again...\nI've been repeating it endlessly.\"": 124,
          "\"That's when it all clicked...\nAnd I remembered everything... every single thing.\"": 125,
          "\"...Nee, \\n[1]!\nI really think, now, we could truly... save the world.\"": 126,
          "Distortion": 127,
          "Let's step into the distortion...": 128,
          "Head inside": 129,
          "Remain here": 130,
          "EV019": 131,
          "\"Shall we enter the distortion...?\"": 132,
          "EV022": 133,
          "\n\\c[23]From now on, you cannot use the 『Fragmented Truth』.": 134,
          "EV023": 135,
          "EV009": 136,
          "EV024": 137,
          "EV025": 138,
          "EV031": 140,
