        "indexIds": {
          "<色調 -30, -30, -30, 0>\r\n<マップ名Hollow_Village >": 0,
          "EV001": 1,
          "EV003": 2,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 3,
          "NW名前指定 Village Girl": 4,
          "\"...What is it?\"": 5,
          "Talk": 6,
          "\\c[2]Rape": 7,
          "Leave": 8,
          "It seems my voice isn't reaching you...": 9,
          "EV005": 10,
          "EV006": 11,
          "EV007": 12,
          "EV008": 13,
          "EV009": 14,
          "EV010": 15,
          "EV011": 16,
          "EV012": 17,
          "EV013": 18,
          "EV014": 19,
          "NW名前指定 Merchant Yun": 20,
          "\"Hey. Welcome to the only shop in this village.\"": 21,
          "Trade": 22,
          "\\c[10]Steal the eyes if(v[61] == 4)": 23,
          "\"Ahaha, ha... um, I overheard your conversation, guys...\nWhether to kill or not, talking about that, well...\nCould you talk about that when I'm not around...?\"": 24,
          "NW名前指定 Eye Hunter, Rau": 25,
          "\"Hmm? What's wrong? kuku...\nHurry up and gouge out those eyeballs.\"": 26,
          "\"Gah...? Rau-chan, why...?\"": 27,
          "\"You'd better be careful too, or else.\nTomorrow, you might end up joining those weirdos wandering outside.\nPrepare here, and you'll save yourself the trouble of digging\nthrough empty shells.\"": 28,
          "\"Have you seen my little brother? He'd laugh all the time...\nIf you happen to see him, could you let me know?\nSince it's him, he's not likely to mess up,\nbut it's been too long for him to just be wandering about.\"": 29,
          "Tell about the brother": 30,
          "Do nothing": 31,
          "It seems you can't hear me...": 32,
          "\"Thank you, onii-san, you saved me...\nI'll give you a discount, so please make sure to visit my shop.\"": 33,
          "\"...And to think Rau-chan would be an Eye Hunter...\nGuess I was right not to get close to her.\"": 34,
          "\"That's what I like to see.\"": 35,
          "\"Onii-san, do you have a thing for dolls?\"": 36,
          "\"Ah! That's right, onii-san, I—!!\nI've got something I need to do!!\nExcuse me for a moment!!\"": 37,
          "\"Hey, wait!! Wait! Please, don't...!!\nNooo!! Please, someone! Help me...!!\\!\n—Ah... ugh...!!\"": 38,
          "\"Oh, a rare traveler? Do you need something?\"": 39,
          "\"Traveler, why did you enter?\"": 40,
          "\"Sir, was your story true?\"": 41,
          "\"From what I've heard, you must be an Eye Hunter.\nI wouldn't have believed it would be you, of all people.\nBut I always thought that girl might be.\"": 42,
          "\"Sir, if you fear that girl, and following her for this reason...\nIf that's the case, it would be a good idea to kill that girl.\nI'll assist you if you have that idea in your head.\"": 43,
          "\"Hmm... The Witch of the Pale White, and Eye Hunters...\nTruly, the world is in utter chaos.\"": 44,
          "\"Thank you. You saved me, sir.\nI probably couldn't have done anything alone...\"": 45,
          "\"I wish I had power like yours...\"": 46,
          "\"Sir, have you seen my sister?\nA girl with black hair, red eyes...\"": 47,
          "\"...Ah, well, it's my greedy sister after all.\nShe's probably scavenging something lying around here!\nAhahaha!!!\"": 48,
          "\"...Sir, were there any Eye Hunters in the village?\nIf you've heard anything, please tell me.\nIt seems my sister was killed by them.\"": 49,
          "\"You should also be careful of the Pale Witch.\n...Though it wouldn't matter, considering how cautious you are.\"": 50,
          "\"Sir... You should also be careful of eye hunters.\n...I never imagined they'd appear in this village.": 51,
          "\"...Hmm. This is troublesome.\"": 52,
          "\"...I see.\"": 53,
          "\"...It's a shame, sir.\"": 54,
          "NW名前指定 Eye Hunter Rau": 55,
          "\"—Damn it!! They got away!!!\"": 56,
          "\"In times like this... this isn't bad, I suppose!\"": 57,
          "\"In times like this... this stock isn't bad, I suppose.\"": 58,
          "\"Traveler, do you have any spare medicine?\nWell, with the outside being like it is, I'm just concerned.\"": 59,
          "NW名前指定 Golden Knight Elcis": 60,
          "\"Oh, sir! You're safe!\nHow about it, would you like to buy something?\"": 61,
          "\"Oh, sir. You're safe!\nHow about it, would you like to buy something?\"": 62,
          "\"My sister was a bit... no, she was quite greedy,\nbut it was her greed that always saved me.\"": 63,
          "\"If not for my sister, I would have starved to death long ago!\nHahahahahaha...!!!\"": 64,
          "\"That's right, Elsis.\nYou should be thankful for big sis' gluttony.\"": 65,
          "\"If not for my sister, I would have starved to death long ago.\"": 66,
          "\"Although my sister and I aren't actually blood relatives.\nUnder these skies, everyone was raised together as a family.\"": 67,
          "\"If you have any trouble, feel free to tell me. I'll help you.\"": 68,
          "\"...Sir.\nDo you have a destination for your journey?\"": 69,
          "\"...No, forget I said anything.\"": 70,
          "EV016<SURLY>": 71,
          "EV017": 72,
          "EV018": 73,
          "EV020<SURLY>": 74,
          "EV021": 75,
          "EV022": 76,
          "EV019": 77,
          "EV023<SURLY>": 78,
          "EV026": 79,
          "EV027": 80,
          "EV028<SURLY>": 81,
          "EV029<SURLY>": 82,
          "EV030": 83,
          "EV031": 84,
          "EV032": 85,
          "EV002": 86,
          "EV025": 87,
          "EV034": 88,
          "EV035": 89,
          "EV036<SURLY>": 90,
          "\"....\"": 91,
          "\"Ah, sir?\"": 92,
          "NW名前指定 Golden Knight Elcis ": 93,
          "\"...Hmm.\nI was prepared, but it's still tough after all.\"": 94,
          "\"It's my greedy sister...\nshe might have gone outside to scavenge...\nWell, that's probably not the case.\"": 95,
          "\"...Hmm.\nIf something has happened to my sister,\nI figure it'd surely fall on the Pale Witch...\"": 96,
          "\"The Eye Hunters, huh...\nIf I had been there, maybe...\n I could have done something about it...\"": 97,
          "\"...Now, I must take my sister's place.\"": 98,
          "\"...Before that, I must thank you.\nPlease take it. I... can't carry it with me anymore.\"": 99,
          "EV037": 100,
          "EV015<SURLY>": 101,
          "EV024<SURLY>": 102,
          "EV004": 103,
          "EV033": 104,
          "Rau": 105,
          "\"Oh, you're here, you're here!! I've been waiting!!\n...Heh. This gal's shaking like a leaf.\"": 106,
          "\"As you can see, this merchant easy to handle for me alone.\n\nBut, I just want to see what you can do.\"": 107,
          "\"...Ah, sorry about that. I'm holding back a lot right now.\nWhen I feel like I'm being watched, I just want to crush something.\nDo it quick. Otherwise, I'll end up doing it myself.\"": 108,
          "\"Come on, hurry up and do it.\nI don't care if it's sloppy, just gouge it out already!\n...Hehe, but after you gouge it out, kill them, okay?\nIt'd be sad to leave them in pain.\"": 109,
          "\\c[10]Don't kill the merchant": 110,
          "\"Kuku... what's wrong? Are you getting cold feet now...!!?\nIf you don't wanna do it, it's fine. I'll do it.\nYou can relax now.\"": 111,
          "\"Naaー Naaー how long's it been since the world became like this?\nI don't really remember much... it's like...\nI don't have any memories from when I was a kid.\"": 112,
          "\"...Eee?\"": 113,
          "\"What is it? Could it be that you are feeling bad?\nThat's a shame... but I get it... sigh...\"": 114,
          "\"Then, I have no choice but to kill you first...\"": 115,
          "\"Haha... that's the worst, yeah...?\nWell, I'm not going to die...\nNext time we meet... remember... okay...\"": 116,
          "\"Ah... they're not here.\nLooks like that witch got ahead of me, huh.\"": 117,
          "\"Sigh... what a shame, she was the most promising one...\nOh well, it sucks that I came here for this, let's go back.\"": 118,
          "\"Oh well, it sucks that I came here for this, let's go back.\"": 119,
          "\"...When my plans get ruined, I get very angry...\nI don't know who are The Four Ethereals or whatever they are,\nbut I want to make them regret taking my prey...\"": 120,
          "\"Oh, here we go. ...Hmm, there's someone I don't recognize...\nThe shopkeeper... There, that golden armor tough-looking guy...\nI can tell, this one's not going to be easy...\"": 121,
          "\"So, hurry up and rip that golden helmet off.\nLet's take those eyes...\"": 122,
          "\"Hurry up, rip off that helmet and take the eyes!\"": 123,
          "\\c[10]Please don't kill the merchant if(s[305] == false)": 124,
          "\\c[10] Kill Rau if(s[305] == true)": 125,
          "\"What's wrong? Scared, huh? Heh... don't worry. I'll be with you.\nThat guy looks pretty strong...!!\"": 126,
          "\"...Oi oi, are you serious?\"": 127,
          "\"...I thought you would understand,\nYou, out of all people...!\"": 128,
          "\"Kukuku... nice...\nThe way I grabbed her, and gouged her eyes out,\nit was good... kuku...\"": 129,
          "\"Oi oi, what's with that gloomy face? Come on, be happy!\nThis is your achievement, right?!\nKukuku... Hah, once you gouge them, they're just eyes...\nbut why does seeing fresh eyes make my stomach sick like this...?\"": 130,
          "\"Alright, let's head back. Give those eyes to that Rofurdias,\nyou may get a reward for giving him those eyes.\"": 131,
          "\"Will she die if you kill her...?\nOf course she will die if you kill her... you...\nWhat are you talking about, you idiot...!?\"": 132,
          "\"Phew, that was a hot hunt!! I dunno what he was trying to do,\nBut I'm glad we killed him before that!!\"": 133,
          "\"Hey, what's with that gloomy face?\nCome on, be happy! This is both your and my achievement, right?!\nKukuku... hah, once you gouge them, they're just eyes...\nbut why does seeing fresh eyes make my stomach sick like this...?\"": 134,
          "\"Now that I think about it,\nI don't feel like hunting your eyes that much...\nIt's like I lost that feeling of stabbing into someone's heart...\nThere's something about you that feels a bit... calming...\"": 135,
          "\"Hehe♪ Hey hey,\nwhat would you do if I said I love you?\nLove, huh... I wonder if it makes you feel like this...\"": 136,
          "\"Speaking of which, I've been wondering.\nThat Rofurdias guy, what if he isn't an Eye Hunter?\nI've never seen him go to collect eyes himself,\nAnd he is strangely calm for an Eye Hunter...\"": 137,
          "EV039": 138
        },
