          "EV021": 29,
          "Soul1": 30,
          "Soul2": 31,
          "EV027": 32,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 33,
          "\"...Huh?\nWhy, Tarian-sama?\nYou still haven't lost your mind, have you...?\"": 34,
          "\"...\"": 35,
          "\"...I don't mind it, I truly don't!\nEven if... my father is like this,\nIf it's like this... I'll accept it...\"": 36,
          "\"Why, why is this happening...?\nFather...? I, I can't anymore...\"": 37,
          "\"Yes, I know, of course...\nI will never forget...\nLoyalty is... within the truth...!!\"": 38,
          "\"Loyalty is...truth...! ! We are together...!\"": 39,
          "\"At any time, at any moment...\nI am a sword that protects the truth...!!\"\n": 40,
          "\\c[2]Rape": 41,
          "Leave": 42,
          "It seems I can't touch her body...": 43,
          "EV028": 44
