          "EV009": 10,
          "EV010": 11,
          "\"Did you wander in from the village...?\nDon't get me wrong, but you should turn back.\nBeyond here there's nothing but hell... and you... heh, hehehe...\"": 12,
          "Trade": 13,
          "Leave": 14,
          "\"Hehe... could it be that you're someone who wants to die?\"": 15,
          "\"I won't stop you, but if you keep going ahead,\nyou'll just die, you know...?\nMaybe I should stop you after all...? Hehe, ahahaha!!\"": 16,
          "\"Hey, you... I bet you're the type who wants it, hee...\nI can tell. You definitely want to give me your souls...\nHehe, hehehe...\"": 17,
          "Talk": 18,
          "\"How cute these little bugs are... they keep crying in my head...\nTsu-tsu, tsu-tsu... hoo, hoo... hehehe, hehehe...\"": 19,
          "\"Ah, it's overflowing with cute little bugs, beautiful trees are\nspreading, and the soil never dries. What a beautiful forest this\nis... I wonder who made such a lovely forest...\nHey, you, who are you...? Please tell me...! ! Hee, hee hee...!\"": 20,
          "\"Ah, there's no need to hold back... souls, all of them,\nevery last one of them...!!\"": 21,
          "\"I'll give you a discount, for old times' sake...!!\nAhahahahaha... Hahaha, ha!\"": 22,
          "\"I love souls... you love souls too, don't you?\nIf you say you don't... that's strange, isn't it?\nThat's really strange...\nBecause you are... hehe, hehehe, hehehehe...!!\"": 23,
          "\"Ah... that's right, a toast...!! To our mothers...!!\nSouls, bring more of them, as many as you can...!!\nHow nostalgic, how fun...! Hey, you...?!\nHehehe, hahaha!! Ahahahaha!!\"": 24,
          "Soul2": 25,
          "Soul1": 26
        },
        "indexIsBuilt": false,
        "progress": {
          "translated": 14,
          "length": 27,
          "percent": 51.85185185185185
        },
        "cellInfo": []
      },
