        "indexIds": {
          "<マップ名Blighted_Swarm >\r\n<色調 -10, -20, -30, 80>\r\n==マップフォグ疫蟲[5,5,50,25,0]==": 0,
          "EV001": 1,
          "EV015": 2,
          "Raisdell": 3,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 4,
          "...Zzzt, zzztzzzt...\nSluurp... gulp...": 5,
          "NW名前指定 Insect Girl Raisdell ": 6,
          "\"...A human?\nAnd what a vibrant, rich human soul...\n...gulp─\"": 7,
          "The woman began to vomit out of her mouth...": 8,
          "\"...Even after vomiting, the emptiness remains.\n\n─Hah, what a pity.\"": 9,
          "\"...Soon, the world will perish.\nThat strong soul of yours... I want your soul...\nYou are the perfect choice for my final feast...\"": 10,
          "Talk": 11,
          "Trade": 12,
          "\\c[2]Rape": 13,
          "Leave": 14,
          "\"I have lived for a long time, being very fortunate to have\ndevoured countless souls...\nEven the insects must be greatly pleased.\"": 15,
          "\"...This is all I can offer you.\nIf you desire more, my magic might consume you...\"": 16,
          "\"...I am a sorceress, after all.\nI have no desire to grant magic that would senselessly kill\nits wielder...\"": 17,
          "\"...You are a peculiar one to seek the power of insects.\nStill, I will give this power to you.\"": 18,
          "\"...Do not let yourself be devoured by the insects.\"": 19,
          "\"...Insect sorcery works by creating insects within your body.\nFeeling fear might cause you to crush the insects that come out of\nthe spell under your feet...\nYou may never know when they might try to enter your body either.\"": 20,
          "\"...If you truly desire insect sorcery...\nReturn before the world ends. I will be waiting...\"": 21,
          "\"...Is it you again? Don't come too close.\nI am starving... I can barely control myself...\"": 22,
          "\"...You are something truly unusual, your soul is far from ordinary.\nIt burns with rage, like the Crimson Wrath itself...\nYour soul defies the natural order of this world.\"": 23,
          "\"...The insects within you whisper to me.\nCountless voices, screaming hopelessly.\"": 24,
          "\"Insects are affected by the light of the world.\nIn this world clouded by illusions...\nthey faintly shine.\"": 25,
          "\"Are you planning to use your light for this world?\nEven at the end of the world, will you refuse to surrender,\nand will you fight against the inevitable?\"\n": 26,
          "Yes": 27,
          "No": 28,
          "\"…Ah, you. You truly want to save this world...\\!\nCan I believe in you?\\! Can I entrust it to you?\\!\nCan I allow myself to have hope in this hopeless world,\nand let my heart be filled with dreams of a good end?\"": 29,
          "\"Ah, how sweet your soul is... If I remain here,\nI will end up eating you...\"": 30,
          "\"...If you truly bring light to this world,\nthen perhaps, somewhere beyond that clarity,\nwe might meet again...?\"": 31,
          "\"No... I'm talking about nonsense...\nPlease take care of yourself.\"": 32,
          "\"...Yes, that's right.\"": 33,
          "\"...Forgive me. Please, leave me alone...\"": 34,
          "\"...Forgive me. I pretty much am an insect...\nEven if I wished otherwise, your scent makes me want to\neat you, even if you go...\nAh- it's irresistible...\"": 35,
          "\"...It's you. Your soul remains as splendid as ever...\"": 36,
          "\"Why would I hate you? I have no reason to.\"": 37,
          "\"This will be my final meal...\nAh, please let me devour your soul...\"": 38,
          "You couldn't bring yourself to answer \"yes.\"": 39,
          "Instead, you shake your head.": 40,
          "\"...I see. That's a shame. I...\nI desire your soul so desperately, so unbearably...\"": 41,
          "\"...\"": 42,
          "\"...I'm surprised.\nI didn't expect anyone to approach me.\"": 43,
          "You were touched all over, her sticky hands clinging to you...": 44,
          "\"...Ah, I'm starving.\"": 45,
          "\"...? ...\"": 46,
          "My finger was bitten...": 47,
          "\"...?\"": 48,
          "I can't seem to have a conversation...": 49,
          "「たわけ……。そなたを嫌う訳など……。」": 50,
          "\"...I don't want to devour you. Please, leave me alone...\"": 51,
          "She's dead...": 52,
          "Large Insect": 53,
          "This": 54,
          "Raisdell (Phantom)": 55,
          "Soul2": 56,
          "Soul1": 57,
