            }
          ]
        ],
        "indexIds": {
          "<マップ名Plague's_Heart >\r\n<色調 -50, -50, 10, 10>\r\n\r\n\r\n0,35,255 → 37\r\n\r\n126": 0,
          "Fetus": 1,
          "\"...\\n[1]. I've been waiting for you.\nAhead, there is a power that will end the world,\n\\c[29]Saruf, The Blue Plague\\c[0], is waiting.\"": 2,
          "\"Let's fight together, \\n[1].\nI can see that you've grown far stronger than before.\nWould you lend me your strength to save the world?\n...Or perhaps you'd rather have me help you?\"": 3,
          "Yes": 4,
          "No": 5,
          "\"...Thank you, \\n[1].\nThese may not be the right words for this moment, but-\nI'm really glad I got to meet you...\"": 6,
          "\"I'll follow you, Please meet him ahead first.\n...I just need a little more time,\nfor both your sake and mine.\"": 7,
          "\"...\"": 8,
          "\"...Understood.\nThen, I'll go alone, or perhaps you will go alone...\"": 9,
          "\"...If you're going to fight alone,\nplease, I beg you, make sure you win.\n...I don't want to see your corpse.\"": 10,
          "\"Defeating Saruf will destroy the plague in the area.\nIt might even be enough to stop the end of the world.\nAt least, there might still be hope...\"": 11,
          "Talk": 12,
          "\\c[2]Rape": 13,
          "Fight together if(s[50])": 14,
          "Leave": 15,
          "\"...\\n[1], I'm a little confused.\"": 16,
          "\"I made eye contact with him earlier, but...\nhow should I put this-\nI didn't feel much hostility from him.\"": 17,
          "\"No matter what, The Ethereal is polluting the land,\ndestroying all life. It needs to be destroyed.\nThat feeling will never change.\nBut...\"": 18,
          "\"...Thank you, \\n[1].\nI'll make sure you never regret that choice.\"": 19,
          "EV002": 20,
          "EV003": 21,
          "EV004": 22,
          "EV005": 23,
          "\n\\{\\{\\{\\c[28]　　　 \\}\\}  \\{\\{BOUNDARY LINKED\\}\\}": 24,
          "The crystal shows no reaction...": 25,
          "EV006": 26,
          "\\c[28]I feel an unusual presence from behind me...": 27,
          "\\c[28]I feel an unusual presence from here...": 28,
          "Saruf<SURLY>": 29,
          "It seems like he's waiting for something...": 30,
          "EV008": 31,
          "Out of nowhere, I lost control of my body...!": 32,
          "\"This is the first time we meet.\"": 33,
          "\"Everyone who appeared in front of me tried to kill me.\"": 34,
          "\"...No, there is no need to have a conversation.\"": 35,
          "\"Let's end this.\"": 36,
          "Soul1": 37,
          "Soul2": 38,
          "EV009": 39,
          "EV012": 40,
          "Fetus - Saruf Defeated": 41,
          "\"\\n[1]...\n...Did we... do it?\nWe really defeated one of the Ethereals, right?\"": 42,
          "\"...\\!But why!?...\\!\nWhy doesn't it feel good...\"": 43,
          "EV014": 44,
          "\"...I remember.\"": 45,
          "That child...\nWhat kind of clothes did they wear...?": 46,
          "\"But... now, if that was really that person...\nI guess it was better this way...\"": 47,
          "\"...Ah, \\n[1].\nSorry... I was just talking to myself.\"": 48,
          "NW名前指定 Fetus": 49,
          "\"Later...\nWhy don't we talk at the Orphanage...?": 50,
          "\"...I remembered something important.\"": 51,
          "EV016": 52,
          "EV017": 53
        },
