          "NW名前指定 Fetus": 47,
          "\"...\\n[1]. It seems like we're headed towards the\n\\c[30]Sky of Abyssal Dream\\c[0]. Be careful as you\nmove forward. It seems like there are a lot of unknown,\nunsettling things around here.\"": 48,
          "Talk": 49,
