          "EV084": 91,
          "EV061": 92,
          "\"Excuse me, sir, can you hear me...?\"": 93,
          "\"Ah, good thing the iron bars are still standing...\nIf you don't mind, would you join me for a short talk...?\"": 94,
          "\"It's alright, I won't harm you...\"": 95,
          "EV085": 96,
          "\"...Excuse me. Can you hear me over there?\"": 97,
          "\"Ah, good... I haven't spoken to anyone in a long time,\nand I was on the verge of losing my mind...\"": 98,
          "\"Ah- thank you so much...\"": 99,
          "\"From what I can see, it seems you haven't received any\n\"favor\" yet. Well, I suppose it doesn't matter.\"": 100,
          "\"You are... different from the Eye Hunters, aren't you?\nI'm not sure how, but you seem different from us as well...\nOh, how interesting...\"": 101,
          "\"Don't worry. I won't harm you. How about it?\nShall we make a deal?\"": 102,
          "\"Would you like to buy a spell...?\nI was really bored so I crafted some spells here...\nI would love to see them being used...\"": 103,
          "Talk": 104,
          "Trade": 105,
          "\\c[2]Rape": 106,
          "\"I have recieved the Maruoris' favor quite easily.\nbut it is not the same level as the others...\nMaybe if I was insane like them I could be happier...\"": 107,
          "\"I'm not on the same level as Mistress Crediur,\nbut I've studied dark magic for quite a bit.\nYou, however, are unlike anyone I've ever known.\nWhat exactly are you...?\"": 108,
          "<SURLY>": 109,
          "EV095": 110,
          "EV096": 111,
          "EV097": 112,
          "EV098": 113,
