          "EV165": 156,
          "NW名前指定 Fetus": 157,
          "\"...It's quite lively here.\nI didn't expect to find a town in such great shape.\"": 158,
          "\"…\\n[1], be careful.\n\\c[30]Abyssal Dream Maruoris\\c[0] is one of the\nFour Ethereals who will lead the world to its end.\nIt seems like they are doing it for a reason, though.\"": 159,
          "\"...Salvation is not what is happening here.\nSure, immortality is a bit intriguing, but...\nIt is a source of the ruin, look what life has become.\nWe can't just ignore that.\"": 160,
