          "\"Ah, you there... stop right there.\"": 59,
          "\"This place is the house of the Eye Hunters... our sanctuary.\"": 60,
          "\"It is a land that must never be gazed upon by outsiders...\nOr perhaps, would you would like to offer your eyes instead?\"": 61,
