        "indexIds": {
          "<マップ名Hal_Riad>\r\n<色調 -61, -102, -1, 10>": 0,
          "EV001": 1,
          "EV002": 2,
          "EV003": 3,
          "EV004": 4,
          "EV005": 5,
          "EV006": 6,
          "EV007": 7,
          "EV008": 8,
          "EV009": 9,
          "EV010": 10,
          "EV011": 11,
          "EV012": 12,
          "EV013": 13,
          "EV014": 14,
          "EV016": 15,
          "EV017": 16,
          "EV018": 17,
          "EV019": 18,
          "EV020": 19,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 20,
          "NW名前指定 Sorcerer Tiwelchi": 21,
          "\"Welcome. To my noble magic shop!\"": 22,
          "Talk": 23,
          "Trade": 24,
          "\\c[2]Rape": 25,
          "Leave": 26,
          "\"You... you've made it this far without the favor?\nOh, That's actually quite impressive.\"": 27,
          "\"So, I assume you came to receive the favor, right?\nConsidering you made it this far on your own,\nI don't think you'll end up like the others.\nYou'll be fine, don't worry!\"": 28,
          "\"So... are you going to buy something?\"": 29,
          "\"Sometimes, I wonder if I really did become immortal.\nI know immortality is real, but it really makes you\nthink you know?\"": 30,
          "\"Oh, how strange. You couldn't even receive the favor,\nand you're not one of the undead either.\nYou're quite the odd person, you know?\nHow does it feel to be truly alive?\"": 31,
          "\"Fufu... did I sound a bit rude?\nI was just genuinely curious. Sorry if I upset you.\"": 32,
          "\"It feels quite nice, doesn't it?\nAll those who ranted about how evil it is to tamper\nwith life, how it's immoral... they're all dead now.\"": 33,
          "\"I wonder if they died in pain, consumed by the plague?\nOr did they die easily, swallowed up by the red lake,\nwithout even feeling the pain?\"\nIf that's the case, I'd find that a bit frustrating.": 34,
          "\"Hey, is everything alright with you?\nYou seem afraid that the White Witch might suddenly come.\nOccasionally, people who claim to have seen the\nWhite Witch here just vanish, you know.\"": 35,
          "\"Let's just pray that we don't cross paths with it.\"": 36,
          "\"You won't regret it. After all, these are my spells.\"": 37,
          "\"Even the Maruoris-sama was impressed by these spells.\nThey're on a whole different level compared to those\nsuspicious miracles. Fufu!\"": 38,
          "EV021": 39,
          "EV022": 40,
          "EV023": 41,
          "EV024": 42,
          "EV025": 43,
          "EV026": 44,
          "<SURLY>": 45,
          "Soul1": 46,
          "Soul2": 47,
          "Rau the Shadowlurker": 48,
          "EV033": 49,
          "\"See? Told you I'd come.\"": 50,
          "\"...According to Rofurdias,\nI'm not a true Eye Hunter.\"": 51,
          "\"But the desire within me is definitely of an Eye Hunter.\nIn other words, my purpose is pretty much unknown.\nThat's what they told me.\"": 52,
          "\"Hey. You... tell me.\"": 53,
          "\"...Naa, \\n[1].\nI'm sure something is wrong with your memory too.\nIt is strange for us to be together here, right...?\"": 54,
          "\"Two of us, together, ended up in this situation...\"": 55,
          "\"If I had known this was going to happen...\nI would have decided it would be better for us to die together...\nWe would have been happy together, wouldn't we?\"": 56,
          "\"Sorry... I guess you don't remember anything, do you?\"": 57,
          "Fusen Rau <SURLY>": 58,
          "\"...Ah. So you came, huh?\"": 59,
          "NW名前指定 Eye Hunter Rau": 60,
          "\"…Ah, sorry. I lied. Thought prey might show up,\nLooks like I was wrong after all. No one came.\"": 61,
          "\".../!\nI... seem different from the other Eye Hunters.\nI thought the Eye Hunters were the strange ones,\nbut turns out… I'm the one who's strange.\"": 62,
          "\"According to Rofurdias, I'm some sort of a special being...\nI was actually invited to the mansion.\\!\nThey want me to support that young lady, Crediur.\"": 63,
          "\"Heh...!! So, I mean, yeah!\nI finally get a chance to smack that bastard Maruorois!\nHe's the one who planted this creepy plague,\nAnd I'm looking forward to getting my revenge, kuku...!!\"": 64,
          "\"...So, long story short, I decided to quit being an Eye Hunter!!\nI'm sorry for dragging you into all this.\nWell then, I'm off to the mansion. You take care now!!\"": 65,
          "She's dead...\nThere's no sign of her coming back to life...": 66,
          "EV035": 67,
          "EV036": 68,
          "EV015": 69,
          "EV037": 70
        },
