        "indexIds": {
          "<マップ名Hal_Riad>\r\n<色調 -61, -102, -1, 10>": 0,
          "EV001": 1,
          "EV002": 2,
          "EV003": 3,
          "EV004": 4,
          "EV005": 5,
          "EV006": 6,
          "EV007": 7,
          "EV008": 8,
          "EV009": 9,
          "NW名前指定 Rofurdias": 10,
          "\"You've been working quite hard, haven't you...?\nAre you starting to feel dissatisfied with your work?\"": 11,
          "\"With this, we'll be able to gouge out two eyes at once.\nFor an Eye Hunter, this must be the greatest bliss,\ndon't you think? Ahahahaha!!\"": 12,
          "\"...You've offered quite a lot of eyes.\nI'll give you this.\"": 13,
          "\"If you don't want it, you can sell it at Tiwelchi's shop.\"": 14,
          "\"This was a blessing found by Lady Crediur.\nI hope it proves useful to you, not to an Eye Hunter.\"": 15,
          "\"You... aren't an Eye Hunter, are you?\nIt seems like you haven't been granted the favor.\"": 16,
          "\"So, what do you say?\nWill you offer your eyes...?\nIf you're willing, I have no objections. Ahahahaha...\"": 17,
          "\"You aren't an Eye Hunter, are you...?\nYou look different from the other Eye Hunters.\"": 18,
          "\"But I don't mind...\nIf you wish to steal their eyes, if that's your desire,\nI'll let you have it... your eyes...!! Ahahahaha!!\"": 19,
          "\"Ah look at you!!\nComing to offer the eyes of your kin... Ahahahaha!!\"": 20,
          "\"...Did you come to offer your eyes?\"": 21,
          "\"You, huh... Come on, offer your eyes!!\"": 22,
          "\"...You. Did you come to offer your eyes?\"": 23,
          "Talk": 24,
          "Give eyes": 25,
          "Leave": 26,
          "\"You... don't seem to know, do you? Eye Hunters are not immortal.\\!\nThey rush to their death dying faster each minute!!\nHow marvelous... Ahahahaha!!!\"": 27,
          "\"Here, would you mind offering your eyes to me...?\nOr should I take them myself? Ahahahaha!!\"": 28,
          "\"Eye Hunters are chosen beings...\nOnly those fully granted the favor can reach the ultimate realm...!!\nAhahahaha!!\"": 29,
          "\"Why have you come to offer the eyes of your kin...?\nYou madman... did you lose your mind at the end, ahahahaha...\"": 30,
          "\"...You're not an Eye Hunter, are you?\nWhat's driving you? What do you see with your eyes?\"": 31,
          "\"Dead...? Ah, yes. Eye Hunters don't possess immortality.\\!\nOur favor is still shrouded in mystery.\nWhat separates the Eye Hunters from the favor...\nWe still don't understand it...": 32,
          "\"...So, it's true. Lady Rau...\\!\nWhat could have deceived her... If it's Maruoris...\"": 33,
          "\"...What about the blessing I gave you?\nIs it completely useless to you?\nThat is a blessing for those of the dark...\nYou should be able to receive it quite easily.\"": 34,
          "\"...Heresy. You shouldn't be here, being like this.\nWith the favor, you must do what you are meant to do.\"": 35,
          "\"...Maestro Maruoris. Please take care of Lady Crediur for me.\"": 36,
          "EV010": 37,
          "Rau": 38,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 39,
          "\"...Hmm? A face I haven't seen before...\\!\nYou're not one of my comrades, are you?\nYou've got some nice, shiny eyes though...\nKukuku... Hey... give them to me!\"": 40,
          "\"─Kukuku!! Gyahahahaha!!\nJust kidding!!\nI don't even remember the faces of my comrades!!\"": 41,
          "\"...Ah, but you really seem different, huh?\nYou've got such irritating eyes...\nI'd love to gouge them out right now and stab you repeatedly...!!\"": 42,
          "NW名前指定 Eye Hunter Rau": 43,
          "\"Kuku... That bastard Maruoris,\nhe sure planted some damn corruption inside of me...\"": 44,
          "\"But still, your eyes... they're in good shape, but\nlooking at them really makes me feel sick...\"": 45,
          "I am a fellow Eye Hunter": 46,
          "\\c[2]Rape": 47,
          "\"From Maruoris' perspective,\nus Eye Hunters seem to be treated like outcasts.\nThat's quite sad, right? Ugh... what a cruel world!!\"": 48,
          "\"But you know, I don't think it's awful. Look at Valley\nkeeping watch outside right now... the common folk have gone crazy!\\!\nThey're all insane, every last one of them!!\nIt's the absolute best!! I never get even a shred of boredom!!\"": 49,
          "\"...But Rofurdias is pretty decent, I guess.\\!\nHis way of talking is a bit creepy, but he's the only rational one\namong the Eye Hunters.\"": 50,
          "\"The eyes of those who've been blessed with favor, but you...\nYour eyes are all mixed up, and it's so creepy...!\nI'm quite curious...! Why do you have eyes like those...!?\"": 51,
          "\"A shop in that rundown village to the south...\nThe Pale Witch, was it? Before she snatches them away,\nwe should just go ahead and take those eyes for ourselves...!!\"": 52,
          "\"Huh? Don't lie!\n...Oh, wait— are you actually interested?!\nHeh, you've got some twisted tastes too...!!\"": 53,
          "\"...I see. So, you're on this side too...!!\nIt's difficult for both of us then!\nBut man, the thrill of crushing an eye—it's irresistible!!\"": 54,
          "\"Alright... So, you wanna go Eye Hunting with me?! Heh... If you're\ndown with it, I've got no problem. There's nothing left in this\nworld, so the two of us going all the way to the end together\ndoesn't sound too bad, does it...?!\"": 55,
          "\"Hmmm? What's wrong? Did you change your mind?\"": 56,
          "Go Eye Hunting": 57,
          "Refuse": 58,
          "\"Kukuku... Are you serious?! You're insane just as I am!\\!\nAlright then, let's head out to hunt right away...!!\"": 59,
          "\"Ohh, guess it was worth inviting you after all...!!\nHeheh... It's nice to have someone who understands me...!!\"": 60,
          "\"Heh... What's with all the indecision, huh?!\\!\nNo, no, I like it. Makes you feel more like a human, at least.\"": 61,
          "\"Whoa, whoa, why are you acting like that...!!\nI don't know what you're planning, but... whatever, it's fine.\"": 62,
          "\"Alright, let's talk about the location...!\\!\nHeh, it's not like we're going on some aimless hunt.\nThere's a spot I've got my eye on...\"": 63,
          "\"Head south from here, all the way down the valley, and pass through\nthe church. Keep going until you find a shop in a village.\nThere seem to be some people still sane!\nIt will be a satisfying hunt indeed!\"": 64,
          "\"Kukuku... Come on, let's go.\nThe fun, fun is about to begin...!!\"": 65,
          "\"Kukuku, you hesitate...!!\nYeah, I get it. You don't want to kill your comrades after all...!!\nOh, that's right, don't do it if you don't want to!!\nIt's meaningless anyway...!!\"": 66,
          "\"Kukuku, that's right...!! It'd be a shame to share when you\ncan get two eyes all for yourself, huh?!\\!\nYou're quite the Eye Hunter yourself...\nThat greed of yours, I'm impressed...!\"": 67,
          "\"Hey, hey, make up your mind!! You act like you are blessed with\nthe favor! If you are so curious about us, just go and receive it\nat this point. You'll find what happens after that very quickly!\"": 68,
          "\"Ahahaha!! Yeah, yeah, if you're hesitating, just don't do it!!\nI can't stand when someone gets angry when I steal their prey!\"": 69,
          "\"Ahh, my bad, my bad!! That damned witch beat me to it!\nShe totally outmaneuvered me!!!\n...Hah, if I'd known it'd end like this,\nI should've just taken them out back then...\"": 70,
          "\"Well, whatever!! Alright, let's talk about the next prey!!\"": 71,
          "\"Yo, welcome back!! Haha, haha!!! ...Ah, sorry, sorry!\nI couldn't resist and got ahead of myself!!\"": 72,
          "\"Well... you know, if we'd just kept waiting, maybe the White Witch\nwould've shown up, and both that guy and I would've been snatched\naway... That'd be the worst ending, scary to think about it, ugh.\"": 73,
          "\"Ah, sorry about that. Hehe.! Don't worry, don't worry,\nWe've got more prey lined up!! So hey, come on! Cheer up!\"": 74,
          "\"So, here's the deal!! Let's talk about the next prey!!\"": 75,
          "\"Yo, welcome back!! Going hunting together is kinda fun, huh!!!\\!\nHehe... I'd be happy if you felt the same.\"": 76,
          "\"Then, let's talk about the next prey!\nOh, did you give those eyeballs to Rofurdias?\nOf course, you can just give a ton of them all at once later!\"": 77,
          "\"Ah, that guy sure ran away in a way that was almost refreshing!\\!\nWell, I don't even feel bad about letting that guy go!\nWe've still got plenty of prey, so let's move on to the next!\"": 78,
          "\"The next prey... um... what was the name again?\\!\nAh, right, it was Rifell!\nI met her at the church, I know her well...\"": 79,
          "\"She said something about visiting her master's grave, right?\\!\nWe'll go wait there for her! Do you know the place? You can get\nthrough the back of the mansion and into the Blood Lake,\nand then there's the graveyard area up ahead.\"": 80,
          "\"Kuku... next time, let's hunt together!\"": 81,
          "\"We will countinue collecting eyeballs, kuku...!\"": 82,
          "\"You can get through the back of the mansion and into the Blood Lake\nand then there's the Martyrdom Cemetery...\nUh, she should be near her master's grave. We'll ambush her there!\"": 83,
          "\"That woman's a bit tough, you know...\nWell, I could probably kill her now, though...\"": 84,
          "\"...Kuku, I'm counting on you.\"": 85,
          "\"Yo...\nAh, damn, looks like I couldn't do a thing in the end...\\!\nWell, I will do better. Don't worry.\nI'll take care of all my frustration in the next hunt.\"": 86,
          "\"Yo...\n...Shall we talk about the next prey?\"": 87,
          "\"Do you know about the mansions to the east of Hal Riad?\nThe target is to the far east, at the southernmost house.\"": 88,
          "\"That's where the prey will be.\nI'll gouge out its eyeballs from the shadows...\nKuku... I'm looking forward to it...\"": 89,
          "\"Hehe... Don't worry about it.\nThe next prey will definitely come. This is for real.\nSo, just come and relax.\"": 90,
          "\"According to Rofurdias,\nit seems like I'm... different even among Eye Hunters...\nSeems like he's suddenly worried about me...\nBut it's too late now...\"": 91,
          "\"\\n[1]... can you listen to me?\nThere's a voice in my head... it won't stop...\nI feel like something is stabbing me with its gaze...\nThat thing has been whispering in my ear the whole time...\"": 92,
          "\"Something about dreams, something about the world...\nIf I listen to it... It'll free me from the this cursed hunting...\nOr so it says...\"": 93,
          "\"It's been going for a while now, mumbling this stuff...\nI feel like I'm losing my mind...\"": 94
        },
