          "EV063<SURLY>": 64,
          "It's locked...": 65,
          "Use the Dream Key": 66,
          "Leave": 67,
          "When I reach out, my arm slips through the door...\nShall I go through the door?": 68,
          "Go through": 69,
          "Remain here": 70,
          "Crediur": 71,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 72,
          "\"To the right, up the stairs there is a lounge on\nthe third floor. Please wait there until the\npreparations for the Ceremony of Favor are complete.\"": 73,
          "Talk": 74,
          "Trade": 75,
          "\\c[2]Rape": 76,
          "\"Do you find it strange that my skin is not purple?\nThe truth is, I am wearing the attire of a human.\"": 77,
          "\"It is not real human skin, of course.\nThat would rot and require far too much maintenance.\n...I am wearing human-like skin, created through magic.\"": 78,
          "\"Should you be fortunate enough to receive the favor,\nI can craft one for you as well, if you so wish.\n...Though, for some reason, no one wants to wear it.\nI wonder why that is?\"": 79,
          "\"Please refrain from wandering around the mansion.\n...There are beings that do not take kindly to humans,\nand the guards will likely attack you.\"": 80,
          "\"Have you met the Eye Hunters?\nThose consumed by favor either become the undead or\nan Eye Hunter, you seem to be a very lucky person.\"": 81,
          "\"Please try receiving the favor one more time.\n...I will call for Maruoris-sama immediately.\"": 82,
          "\"Er... you wish to buy something?\nI do not have anything for sale, but...\n...Very well. I will make an exception, just for you.\"": 83,
          "\"I apologize.\nI'm not used to this kind of interaction...\nAre these prices too expensive for you...?\"": 84,
          "Bosclay": 85,
          "\"...Beyond this point lies our sanctuary.\nWithout the permission of Maruoris-sama, entry is\nstrictly forbidden. Please wait in the rest area.\"": 86,
          "\"Could it be... are you free at the moment?\nIf so, shall we have a conversation?\"": 87,
          "\"I will be your companion, so please, do not venture\nany further. ...I beg of you.\"": 88,
          "\"I have called for Maruoris-sama, but preparations\nare taking longer than expected...\nPlease, bear with me for a little longer…\"": 89,
          "\"No...\nWhy is it taking so long?\nI've been looking forward for this moment for so long.\"": 90,
          "\"Or could it be...\"": 91,
          "Cree": 92,
          "\"...Guest. Beyond here lies the sanctum of dark beings.\nOnly those granted permission by Maruoris-sama may\nenter this place.\"": 93,
          "\"...If possible, I do not wish to harm you.\nPlease, I beg you. Do not proceed any further.\"": 94,
          "Extraordinary": 95,
          "I feel an unusual presence from behind...": 96,
          "I feel an unusual presence from here...": 97,
          "EV078": 98,
          "\"I cannot...\nI can't break my promise to Maruoris-sama.\"\n": 99,
          "\"I apologize for my rough behavior.\n...Please, refrain from such actions any longer.\"": 100,
          "\"...Please return to the resting room.\"": 101,
          "\\c[2]Get out of the way": 102,
          "Return": 103,
          "\"...\"": 104,
          "\"...Ah, I'm relieved.\nI thought I was going to lose.\"": 105,
          "\"Please, don't do such things anymore. ...Maruoris-sama\nis the one who rules over the Realm of Dreams.\nA promise made with such a person can never be broken.\"": 106,
          "I lost consciousness in an instant, and before I knew it,\nI had already climbed the stairs...": 107,
          "\"Maruoris-sama...\"": 108,
