        ],
        "indexIds": {
          "<マップ名Abyssal_Sanctum >\r\n<色調 30, -58, 31, 0>": 0,
          "EV001": 1,
          "Maruoris <SURLY>": 2,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 3,
          "\"Maruoris-sama. The sky is getting even darker.\"": 4,
          "\"Is there anything... we can do?\"": 5,
          "NW名前指定 Abyssal Dream Maruoris ": 6,
          "\"I tried everything I could... I don't have any other plans.\"": 7,
          "\"...\"": 8,
          "\"Soon, all life in the world will be extinct,\nand the world will die. Only we will survive.\"": 9,
          "\"...Is there truly nothing we can do?\nAre we just going to stand and...\nsilently watch as it all ends?\"": 10,
          "\"...Gwirionedd.\"": 11,
          "\"All we can do is offer prayers to her.\nWe must still believe, beyond this 'Corruption',\nthat she is there somewhere, trying to save us.\"": 12,
          "\"...Yes.\n'Favor', right?\nThe favor that Maruoris has granted to the world.\nI'm sure the time will come.\"": 13,
          "\"...Until the final moment, I will support you.\nPlease, hold onto your strength...\"": 14,
          "Looking up at the sky, standing still...": 15,
          "NW名前指定 Maruoris": 16,
          "\"...When Wrath appeared in this world, for me everything was buried\nin darkness. Ever since then, this was the first time I managed\nto see the light.\"": 17,
          "\"...Messenger! Everyone is relying on you.\"": 18,
          "EV007": 19,
          "EV008": 20,
          "EV009": 21,
          "I feel an unusual presence from behind...": 22,
          "I feel an unusual presence from here...": 23,
          "EV011": 24,
          "Out of nowhere, I lost control of my body...!": 25,
          "\"...I've been waiting for you.\"": 26,
          "\"...We must act quickly, we have no time left.\nFirst, tell me. What has Gwirlionedd tasked you with?\"": 27,
          "\\c[2]I come to kill you": 28,
          "What should we do?": 29,
          "\\c[2]I can't speak...": 30,
          "\"....\nDid Gwirionedd tell you to kill me?\"": 31,
          "\\c[2]Begging for your life?": 32,
          "\"...What are you talking about?\n\nCan you not hear my words...?\"": 33,
          "\\c[2]That's nothing but deception.": 34,
          "\"...I see. Something's wrong.\nIt's as if the ending has already been written, and you're speaking\nas if it's all set, continuing the story like this...\nIt seems everything was decided before you came here.\"": 35,
          "\"...But I can feel it. There is someone else within you.\nThis is not you, something is controlling you.\"": 36,
          "\\c[2]Ready your weapon": 37,
          "\"...It's clear you don't want this either, just like me.\"": 38,
          "NW名前指定 Abyssal Dream Maruoris": 39,
          "\"...Messenger!\nLet us hope that after the battle, we can have a conversation.\"": 40,
          "\"...So, we really must fight. Truly regrettable.\"": 41,
          "\"...Finally, it's over at least.\"": 42,
          "\"─What is this?\"": 43,
          "\"Wait, what's going on?\"": 44,
          "\"...Am I going to die?\"": 45,
          "\n\\{\\{\\{\\c[30]　  \\} \\{YOU APPROACHED THE END \\}\\}": 46,
          "\"...Khh.\n\"...Finally, it's over.\"": 47,
          "EV003": 48,
          "EV004": 49,
          "EV002": 50,
          "EV005": 51,
          "Soul1": 52,
          "Soul2": 53,
          "フェトゥス": 54,
          "NW名前指定 Fetus": 55,
          "\"...Is it... cold?\"": 56,
          "\"I didn't notice during the fight, but...\nIt's so cold here...\"": 57,
          "\"I can't stop shaking...\nHuh? It's... so cold... this is so strange...\"": 58,
          "Hug her": 59,
          "Leave": 60,
          "It seems you haven't noticed my hug...": 61,
          "\"...Nee, \\n[1]. I wonder why.\"": 62,
          "\"I... I feel a little happy.\"": 63,
          "\"It's normal to be happy, since we defeated Maruoris but...\"\n\"No, never mind. Forget it.\"": 64,
          "EV016": 65,
          "\"...I remember.\"": 66,
          "\"I know... Maruoris.\"": 67,
          "\"That's the only thing I can remember, but...\"": 68,
          "\"...I'm starting to remember, other things too.\"": 69,
          "\"Nee, \\n[1]...\"": 70,
          "\"Let's meet at the orphanage later.\"": 71,
          "\"There's something I want to talk about...\"": 72
        },
        "indexIsBuilt": false,
        "progress": {
          "translated": 57,
          "length": 73,
          "percent": 78.08219178082192
