          "\"Can you hear it? Can you see me? No, not yet...\nBut you will. Oh, you WILL. Save me... please, save me...\nReach out, just once... just one touch!\"": 10,
          "\"You can't see me? You can't hear me? Oh, how strange... but... it-\nIt doesn't matter anymore. I'm used to being ignored...\nA little sad, perhaps... but I don't mind. Not anymore...\"": 11,
