          "Soul2": 13,
          "EV039": 14,
          "EV041": 15,
          "EV042": 16,
          "EV053": 17,
          "NW名前指定 Fetus": 18,
          "\"Ah, \\n[1]... We are under the \\c[18]Sky of Crimson Wrath\\c[0].\"": 19,
          "\"Look at the state of things, huh?\nEveryone, everyone... they fought that thing and... they died.\"": 20,
          "\"...\\c[18]Dial\\c[0].\"": 21,
          "\"The truth is, \\c[18]Dial\\c[0] was the one who was supposed to bring the end\nof the world... The Four Ethereals were supposed to end the world\ntogether but, but... No one remembers him anymore...\"": 22,
          "\"...\"": 23,
          "\"Nee, \\n[1]...\nSince I met you, I've been noticing just how much I've forgotten...\nI'm starting to notice it.\"": 24,
          "\"...But there's definitely something ahead that I shouldn't know.\nWell, it's normal that I don't know...\nI've never seen a monster like that before...\"": 25,
          "\"... I don't know. I don't know that thing.\nI swear, I've never seen anything like it...\"": 26,
          "Talk": 27,
          "\\c[2]Rape": 28,
          "Leave": 29,
          "\"...My mother used to say this a lot.\nOutside is full of \\c[23]Monsters\\c[0] and I shouldn't stray far from home...\"": 30,
          "<SURLY>": 31,
          "EV043": 32,
          "EV044": 33,
          "EV045": 34,
          "EV046": 35,
          "EV047": 36,
          "EV048": 37,
