          "Lost Path": 33,
          "EV040": 34,
          "EV042": 35,
          "EV043": 36,
          "EV044": 37,
          "Cream bread and Yogurt\nGarlic toast and Cupcakes\nButter toast and Orange juice\nRoll bread and Pancakes": 38,
          "There is Strawberry Cake tomorrow!": 39,
          "EV046": 40,
          "[Rules of the Garden]\n- If you wanna leave the Obetion, tell to the Mother first.\n- Take care of the flowers, environment, and animals.\n- If you get sick, immediately tell Unwild or the Mother.": 41,
          "- If something dangerous happens, leave it to Unwild.\n- If you encounter something scary, run home or call for Unwild.\n- If you want something, tell the Mother.": 42,
          "EV047": 43,
          "EV048": 44,
          "EV049": 45,
