        ],
        "indexIds": {
          "<マップ名Cemetery >\r\n==マップフォグ日差し_殉教[0,0,10,150,1]==\r\n<色調 10, 10, -5, 0>": 0,
          "Grave of the Sword": 1,
          "Rifell - Ahead": 2,
          "\"You...\nWe met at the church, didn't we?\"": 3,
          "\"Over there, you will find the grave of Arkos-sama.\nThough the gravestone itself was crafted by the people\nof Crimson Wrath... It's still my master's grave.\"": 4,
          "\"...Please, offer your respects at the grave...\"": 5,
          "\"...I was utterly powerless.\nBut truly, you couldn't find anyone else like him.\nHe was worthy enough to be called 'Sword of Dreams'.\"": 6,
          "\"...No matter what may happen in there,\nyour body shall remain untouched by harm...\n...May fortune favor you in battle.\"": 7,
          "\"─What... You have defeated Arkos-sama!?\"": 8,
          "\"Then surely, you can...\nEven defeat the Crimson Wrath itself, can you not?\"": 9,
          "\"My master's wish is destruction of the Crimson Wrath.\nI was so determined to be the be the one to fulfill it.\nBut it seems it is you who is truly worthy of it...\"": 10,
          "Her eyes have been stolen..": 11,
          "Rifell": 12,
          "She's dead...": 13,
          "\"...Ah...\nYou there... you over there...\"": 14,
          "\"Do you have... Any medicine...?\nMy body... It can't move at all...\"": 15,
          "\"I... can't believe I'm dying here...\nNot in here...\"": 16,
          "\"Ah...\nA pilgrim... Over here...": 17,
          "\"Do you have... Any medicine...?\nMy body... I can't move anymore...\"": 18,
          "\"I must, I must defeat the Crimson Wrath\"\n": 19,
          "\"...Please... fulfill my master's wish...\"\n": 20,
          "\"Please, fulfill the will of my master, Arkos...\nAnd of Tarian...\nAnd... my own will as well...\nPlease, please... carry it on...\"": 21,
          "\\c[10]\"Thus, the will of the sword has been crushed...\nThe world will soon meet its end...\nThere is no way to stop it...\nLet us spend this time of sorrow together...\"": 22,
          "\\c[10]The tragic cycle born from revenge...\nEveryone, fighting foolishly in the name of the sword and master...\nThey perish before the Crimson Wrath...\nAh, how pitiful...\"": 23,
          "EV014": 24,
          "EV015": 25,
          "EV016": 26,
          "EV017": 27,
          "EV018": 28,
