          "EV046": 52,
          "EV047": 53,
          "EV001": 54,
          "On the Grave\r\n": 55,
          "Under the Grave": 56,
          "Blood - Left": 57,
          "Blood - Right": 58,
          "EV006": 59,
          "EV007": 60,
          "Grave of the Sword / Entrace": 61,
          "Put your hands together and meditate.": 62,
          "Leave": 63,
          "Soul1": 64,
          "Soul2": 65,
          "Elcis<SURLY>": 66,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 67,
          "\"...Ohhh! Hm, hmm, hmm... Ha ha ha... Ahahaha...!!\"": 68,
          "\"...Hmm?\"": 69,
          "\"─Oh! No, my apologies! I was just reading something interesting\nI found in the orphanage, which was supposed to be empty.\nIt was a little novel written by the children that stayed there.\"": 70,
          "\"Well, those children are probably no longer in this world.\nWhether it was based on real events or not...\nIt's quite a heartwarming little adventure tale... Ha ha ha...\"": 71,
          "NW名前指定 Golden Knight Elcis": 72,
          "\"...Ahem! I am Elcis.\nMy sister asked me to find something valuable, I found it but...\nI'm wearing it instead of carrying it.\nIt's too heavy, you see! Ha ha ha ha!!\"": 73,
          "\"Hmm... It's about time my sister will start to worry,\nso I suppose I'll head back.\nThough, I'm hesitant to soak my armor in that bloody water,\nI guess there's no helping it...\"": 74,
          "\"But, my friend, considering how you fight, well, don't you\nthink living under the Sky of Crimson Wrath might actually be\npreferable for you?! Ah ha ha ha ha...!!\"\n": 75,
          "EV059": 76,
          "NW名前指定 Fetus": 77,
          "\"This is...\nThe grave of the Sword of Dreams, Arkos... it seems.\"": 78,
          "\"And, all the graves here...\nThey belong to the followers of the sword.\"": 79,
          "\"They all perished here, under the \\c[18]Sky of Crimson Wrath\\c[0]...\"": 80,
          "\"...Sorry. I'm just not feeling well right now...\"": 81,
          "Talk": 82,
          "\\c[2]Rape": 83,
          "\"...The sword, the shield, and the spear.\nLed by Arkos, the knights of the sword stood against Dial...\"": 84,
          "\"...I don't really get it, though.\"": 85,
          "<SURLY>": 86,
          "EV063": 87,
          "NW名前指定 Eye Hunter Rau": 88,
          "\"Yo.\nLooks like the guy still hasn't shown up...\"": 89,
          "\"Or maybe he came and left already?\nOr got eaten by some monsters from around here? Kuku...\nWhatever. I'll just wait.\"": 90,
          "\"...Ah. This could be a long wait.\nSo if you can't stand it, go ahead, leave.\nDoesn't matter to me.\"": 91,
          "\"Heh... Or maybe you wanna stick around and wait with me?\nWould be nice, ain't no fun being alone...!!\nKukuku...\"": 92,
          "\"Yo... Heh, got a little prey here.\nHey, can you go talk to that one?\nIf you chat, she won't be on guard.\nThen, I can take care of 'em from the back, nice and quick.\"": 93,
          "\"Kuku... Wanna just rush in and attack head-on?\nIf that's what you want, I'll follow your lead.\nIt'd be more fitting for an eye hunt... thrilling, isn't it...!!\nKukuku... Do as you like...\"": 94,
          "\"Rush in from the front,\nor should I sneak in and take care of it from behind?\nKuku... I'm fine with however you wanna do it.\"": 95,
          "\\c[2]Kill Rau": 96,
          "\"When you wanna go, just give me a sign.\nI'll strike from the shadows. Kukuku...!!\"": 97,
          "\"...Hey, what kind of joke is this?\"": 98,
          "\"...Tch.\nHow disappointing. I thought we could've gotten along, but...\"": 99,
          "\"I'll just be revived if I die anyway...\nMaybe it'd be better to end it all right now...!!\"": 100,
          "EV064<SURLY>": 101,
          "\"...Ah. It's you...\"": 102,
          "\"...By the time I arrived... she was already dying.\"": 103,
          "\"She...\nShe asked me to end her suffering... Ha, ha...\nI was going to do that from the start...\"": 104,
          "\"...Hey.\nCould you do me a favor?\nNo, it has nothing to do with eye hunting...\nI'm going after the one who killed her.\"": 105,
          "\"You must have some anger to vent, too.\nYou've been with me for this long,\nand now you're being kept here a second time...\"\n": 106,
          "\"...Well, I've taken what I needed. Let's go back now.\"": 107,
          "\"...Sorry.\nI really wanted to hunt with you, but...\nSomething just doesn't seem right.\"": 108,
          "\"...By the time I arrived... it was already too late.\"": 109,
          "\"In these times, only someone like her...\nThere could only be one person with blonde hair who\nwould come to a place like this.\"": 110,
          "\"...Looks like the eyeballs are all gone.\nNo need to check more... Let's go.\"": 111,
          "\"...Why the hell am I feeling like this?\nIs it because if I kill them then nothing's wrong...?\nBut when someone else does it instead...?\"": 112,
          "\"What's this about 'Wanting me to kill you'...?\nAre you an idiot!?\nStupid... letting yourself be killed like that...\"": 113,
          "\"...Hah, my prey was stolen before I even got a chance.\nHaha... I'm really angry...\"": 114,
          "\"...Let's kill that bastard who took our prey.\nThat damn Crimson Wrath, the one who stole from us.\"": 115,
          "\"...Sorry.\nCan you just leave me alone for a bit...?\"": 116,
          "Cooperate with Rau if(s[218] == false && s[315] == false)": 117,
          "Defeat the culprit if(s[218] == true && s[315] == false)": 118,
          "\"...Leave me alone...\"": 119,
          "\"...Sigh.\nI hate to say it, but I wanted to kill her.\nIf I could I would've done it without hesitation.\"": 120,
          "\"...What a shame.\nI wanted to see her beautiful face one last time.\"": 121,
          "\"...Is it okay?\n...Hehe, thanks.\nI've been smelling something for a while now.\nSadness or anger, perhaps it's the Crimson Wrath...\"": 122,
          "\"...Huh?\nHave you gone and defeated them for me already?\nOh... I see... You're so kind...\"": 123,
          "\"...No.\nActually, I wish you took me with you...\"": 124,
          "It seems I can't touch her body...": 125,
          "EV065": 126,
          "EV066": 127,
          "\\c[2]Send a signal to Rau": 128,
          "\\c[2]Kill her head-on": 129,
          "\"─That's right.\nThere is one thing I must ask you.\"": 130,
          "\"Have you seen a girl around here...?\nShe has black hair and purple eyes...\"": 131,
          "\"No, I'm sure she's somewhere around here...!\"": 132,
          "\"─R-Rau...?\"": 133,
          "\"...\"": 134,
          "\"Rau...!! It's you, isn't it?!\nAh, do you remember me?!\nIt's... it's Rifell!!\"": 135,
          "\"Ah, this scent...\nI could never forget it, no matter how hard I tried...!\nRau, you're alive...\nI'm so glad... so glad...!!\"": 136,
          "\"...No.\"": 137,
          "\"What do you mean, 'no'...?\nHeh... you've grown so much...\nPretty soon, you'll be taller than me, huh?\"": 138,
          "\"...I told you, I'm not the Rau you used to know...\nI came here to hunt your eyes...\"": 139,
          "\"...It doesn't matter.\nNo matter what, Rau will always be Rau...!\n...Are you scared? It's okay.\nBig sister will protect you, Rau...\"": 140,
          "\"Ah... that's right. I'm scared... Those eyes...\"": 141,
          "\"─Those eyes are scary!!!\"": 142,
          "\"...Here, are you comfortable now?\"": 143,
          "\"...Rau.\nNo matter what you've become...\nI still love you...\"": 144,
          "\"...Fufu.\nYou're still so warm...\"": 145,
          "\"...It's the eyes.\nI have to steal my next set of eyes...\nI can't stop this feeling, I need to crush them all...\"": 146,
          "\"─What are you doing...!!?\"": 147,
          "\"─...!\"": 148,
          "\"─Rau...!?\"": 149,
          "\"...Yo.\nI came to steal your eyes.\"": 150,
          "\"…Eh?\nYou, don't tell me... you became an Eye Hunter...?\"": 151,
          "\"...I didn't become one because I wanted to.\"": 152,
          "\"...Rau.\nYou're alive... I'm so glad...\"": 153,
          "\"...Sorry, can you just die quietly.\"": 154,
          "\"...Can't we talk at least?\"": 155,
          "\\{ \"I told you to shut up and die!!\"": 156,
          "\"─Ah... what is this...?\nI've never seen anything like this before...\"": 157,
          "\"...The eyes...!\nI have to hunt the eyes... I have to hunt them all...\nThe voices, the trembling, the fear...\nIt won't stop...! It makes me go insane!\"": 158,
          "EV067": 159,
          "Shadow Lurker Rau": 160
        },
        "indexIsBuilt": false,
