          "Defeated One's Grave - Lower": 14,
          "EV016": 15,
          "Out of nowhere, I lost control of my body...!\n": 16,
          "\"...What a sorrowful world this is.\"": 17,
          "\"Full of blood, full of tears, full of rage, full of revenge...\nHating each other, killing each other, vengeance...\nNow, everything is about to disappear...\"": 18,
          "\"...How sorrowful this world has become.\"": 19,
          "\"...This will be the final grave.\nOur world's... grave.\"": 20,
          "NW名前指定 Eye Hunter Rau": 21,
          "\"Dammit...!!\"": 22,
          "\"You...!!\"": 23,
          "\"Someone like you...!!\"": 24,
          "\"Someone like you... of all people...!!\"": 25,
          "\"Dammit!!\"": 26,
          "\"Dammit!\"": 27,
          "\"Dammit...!!!\"": 28,
          "\"...Thank you. Thank you for your cooperation.\"": 29,
          "\"....By the way, I never asked for your name...\nWhat is it?\"": 30,
          "\"\\n[1]... ─\\n[1]...?\"": 31,
          "\"─Ah, ahh, yeah. Right...\"": 32,
          "\"...I'll remember it.\"": 33,
