        "indexIds": {
          "<色調 -70, -70, -70, 60>\r\n<マップ名Hunting_Prison >": 0,
          "EV001": 1,
          "Elcis <SURLY>": 2,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 3,
          "NW名前指定 Golden Knight Elcis": 4,
          "\"Ah, you are here as well!! Hahaha!!\nI thought something valuable was on the ground, so I came closer,\nbut it was just...!! Hahahahaha!!\"": 5,
          "\"Hah... I never would have thought pranksters\nlike this still existed in the world today!!\nSeems like the world isn't completely lost after all!\"": 6,
          "\"Well, I took a little stroll around,\nbut I took a painful blow to the stomach. I'm too scared to go now.\nI know it's a bit embarrassing to ask, but could you please,\ngo and... deal with that thing for me...?\"": 7,
          "\"Hmm...\nIt's almost as if 『Hunter Hela』 is targeting me...\"": 8,
          "Regarding『Hunter Hela』": 9,
          "I defeated her": 10,
          "Be silent": 11,
          "\"Mm? Oh, you're curious, huh!?\nThis is a novel written by a child from the orphanage.\n『The Secret Treasure Hunt of Fetus and Risu』...\nThey were attacked by 'Hunter Hela' in this story.\"": 12,
          "\"They fell into a prison filled with traps, and they realized\nthey were being targeted with a gun from somewhere,\nthey dodged the bullets and began to think of a way to escape from\nthis maze-like prison.\"": 13,
          "\"The two of them caught Hela, who was lured by the smell of\nsnacks, and 『Hunter Hela』 became their ally...!\nHeh, it's funny... It almost feels like we are in the story.\nI hope this one gets lured by snacks too, hahaha!\"": 14,
          "\"—Oh! You!! Sir!\nDid you defeat that demon!? Thank you!\nI'll have to repay you for this someday!!\"": 15,
          "\"Now then, we'll have to find a way out of this maze...\nHmm, even if we escape, I have no idea where we'll end up,\nbut I suppose we have no choice but to head towards the church...\"": 16,
          "Before I knew it, the man had disappeared...": 17,
          "EV004": 18
        },
        "indexIsBuilt": false,
        "progress": {
          "translated": 14,
          "length": 19,
          "percent": 73.68421052631578
        },
