          "EV002": 13,
          "Get \\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]": 14,
          "Get \\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]": 15,
          "Convert \\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0] to \\c[23]Call\\c[0]": 16,
          "Convert \\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0] to \\c[24]Cry\\c[0]": 17,
          "\\c[23]Call\\c[0]: Restores 50% HP.\n　　　　　　　↓\n\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]: Restores 50% HP.\\c[10] (No turn cost)": 18,
          "『Trade『\\c[2]3 \\c[0]\\c[23]Call\\c[0]』 to get 『\\c[2]1 \\c[0]\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]』.\n\n\\c[2]※ You cannot trade unless you have obtained at least 3 Calls.": 19,
          "『Trade \\c[2]3 \\c[0]\\c[23]Call\\c[0]』 to get 『\\c[2]1 \\c[0]\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]』.\nEnter the number of Whispering Calls to obtain.\n\\c[8]Call owned: \\v[21]　　\\c[2]Tradeable Whispering Call: \\v[1]\n\\c[7]※ If you enter more than you have, all of it will be converted.": 20,
          "\\c[24]Cry\\c[0]: Restores 50% MP.\n　　　　　　　↓\n\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]: Restores 50% MP.\\c[10] (No turn cost)": 21,
          "『Trade \\c[2]3 \\c[0]\\c[24]Cries\\c[0]』 to get 『\\c[2]1 \\c[0]\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]』.\n\n\\c[2]※ You cannot trade unless you have obtained at least 3 Cries.": 22,
          "『Trade \\c[2]3 \\c[0]\\c[24]Cry\\c[0]』 to get 『\\c[2]1 \\c[0]\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]』.\nEnter the number of Shrill Cries to obtain.\n\\c[8]Cry owned: \\v[22]　　\\c[2]Tradeable Shrill Cry: \\v[1]\n\\c[7]※ If you enter more than you have, all of it will be converted.": 23,
          "\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]: Restores 50% HP. (No turn cost)\n　　　　　　　↓\n\\c[23]Call\\c[0]: Restores 50% HP.": 24,
          "『Trade \\c[2]1 \\c[0]\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]』 and get 『\\c[2]3 \\c[0]\\c[23]Call\\c[0]』.\n\n\\c[2]※ You cannot trade unless you have obtained a Whispering Call.": 25,
          " 『Trade \\c[2]1 \\c[0]\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]』 and get 『\\c[2]3 \\c[0]\\c[23]Call\\c[0]』.\nEnter the number of Whispering Calls to obtain.\n\\c[2]Whispering Call owned: \\v[52]　　\\c[8]Call owned: \\v[21]\n\\c[7]※ The maximum item count is 99.": 26,
          "\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]: Restores 50% MP. (No turn cost)\n　　　　　　　↓\n\\c[24]Cry\\c[0]: Restores 50% MP.": 27,
          "\"『Trade \\c[2]1 \\c[0]\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]』 and get 『\\c[2]3 \\c[0]\\c[24]Cries\\c[0]』.\n\n\\c[2]※ You cannot trade unless you have obtained a Shrill Cry.": 28,
          "『Trade \\c[2]1 \\c[0]\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]』 and get 『\\c[2]3 \\c[0]\\c[24]Cry\\c[0]』.\nEnter the number of Shrill Cries to obtain.\n\\c[2]Shrill Cry owned: \\v[53]　　\\c[8]Cry owned: \\v[21]\n\\c[7]※ The maximum item count is 99.": 29,
          "Perform Voice Conversion": 30,
          "Leave": 31,
          "Convert \\c[23]Call\\c[0] to \\c[24]Cry\\c[0]": 32,
          "Convert \\c[24]Cry\\c[0] to \\c[23]Call\\c[0]": 33,
          "Convert \\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0] to \\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]": 34,
          "Convert \\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0] to \\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]": 35,
          "\\c[23]Call\\c[0]: Restores 50% \\c[23]HP\\c[0].\n　　　　　　　↓\n\\c[24]Cry\\c[0]: Restores 50% \\c[24]MP\\c[0].": 36,
          "Convert 『\\c[23]Call\\c[0]』 to 『\\c[24]Cry\\c[0]』.\n\n\\c[2]※ You cannot convert unless you have obtained a Call.": 37,
          "Convert 『\\c[23]Call\\c[0]』 to 『\\c[24]Cry\\c[0]』.\nEnter the number of Calls to convert.\n\\c[2]Call owned: \\v[21]　　\\c[8]Cry owned: \\v[22]\n\\c[7]※ The maximum item count is 99.": 38,
          "\\c[24]Cry\\c[0]: Restores 50% \\c[24]MP\\c[0].\n　　　　　　　↓\n\\c[23]Call\\c[0]: Restores 50% \\c[23]HP\\c[0].": 39,
          "Convert 『\\c[24]Cry\\c[0]』 to 『\\c[23]Call\\c[0]』.\n\n\\c[2]※ You cannot convert unless you have obtained a Cry.": 40,
          "Convert 『\\c[24]Cry\\c[0]』 to 『\\c[23]Call\\c[0]』.\nEnter the number of Cry to convert.\n\\c[2]Cry owned: \\v[22]　　\\c[8]Call owned: \\v[21]\n\\c[7]※ The maximum item count is 99.": 41,
          "\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]: Restores 50% \\c[23]HP\\c[0]. (No turn cost)\n　　　　　　　↓\n\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]: Restores 50% \\c[24]MP\\c[0]. (No turn cost)": 42,
          "Convert 『\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]』 to 『\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]』.\n\n\\c[2]※ You cannot convert unless you have obtained a Whispering Call.": 43,
          "Convert 『\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]』 to 『\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]』.\nEnter the number of Whispering Calls to convert.\n\\c[2]Whispering Call owned: \\v[52]　　\\c[8]Shrill Cry owned: \\v[53]\n\\c[7]※ The maximum item count is 99.": 44,
          "\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]: Restores 50% \\c[24]MP\\c[0]. (No turn cost)\n　　　　　　　↓\n\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]: Restores 50% \\c[23]HP\\c[0]. (No turn cost)": 45,
          "Convert 『\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]』 to 『\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]』.\n\n\\c[2]※ You cannot convert unless you have obtained a Shrill Cry.": 46,
          "Convert 『\\c[24]Shrill Cry\\c[0]』 to 『\\c[23]Whispering Call\\c[0]』.\nEnter the number of Shrill Cries to convert.\n\\c[2]Shrill Cry owned: \\v[53]　　\\c[8]Whispering Call owned: \\v[52]\n\\c[7]※ The maximum item count is 99.": 47,
          "Cancel": 48,
          "EV003": 49,
          "Sing a Song": 50,
          "Convert 3『\\c[1]Nursery Rhyme Fragment\\c[0]』to 1『\\c[24]Nursery Rhyme Melody\\c[0]』.\nEnter the number of Melodies you want to obtain.\n\\c[7](Fragments owned: \\v[1]) \\c[2](Convertible quantity: \\v[2])\n\\c[7]※ If you enter more than you have, all of it will be converted.": 51,
          "EV014": 52,
          "\"Ah, the\n                 sensei\n                        is inside                   the house!!\"": 53,
          "\"Hello!\"": 54,
          "Talk": 55,
          "\"Are you        a       soldier?\nA-       ah,  could     it    be  !     !\n                 Did you        bring\n                                                 Food!?\"": 56,
          "\"As               al   ways\n          t ha   n  k       you s   o   m  uc  h!!\"\n": 57,
          "\"Ah,        Mel  f-        chan         !   !\n\n         Could      it be...     Did you bring        cake!?\"": 58,
          "\"There's        enough for           everyone!\nS   o      Mu   ch!!\nThank          you, Mel    f-c  han, I         love     it!\"": 59,
          "\"Y   es        !  !\n           I'm      do   ing       w     ell!!\n      ...Hey, do you         know       Melf-        chan?\"": 60,
          "\"A- a   h,    u      m...\n    Sen   sei    i s     inside   t  he    hou    se!!\n     A                            h,   a ls   o,\n           d   o   you   wa   nt   cake    onee-  ch   an?\"": 61,
          "\"Uu         nn!!\n           Le  ave   i t    t o     m e!!\n     Be       cau       se Me l f-  ch  an\n                     is    my   fri     end!!\"": 62,
