        ],
        "indexIds": {
          "Promised Garden - Seren": 0,
          "<マップ名Garden_Seren>\r\n<色調 -40, -40, 50, 0>": 1,
          "EV001": 2,
          "Soul1": 3,
          "Soul2": 4,
          "Risu": 5,
          "Trade": 6,
          "Leave": 7,
          "EV005": 8,
          "She's dead...": 9,
          "EV007": 10,
          "EV008": 11,
          "\"...Ara.\"": 12,
          "\"...Welcome.\"": 13,
          "\"But... you're quite early, aren't you?\nDid you really want to meet me so badly? Ufufufufu...\"": 14,
          "\"...I'm so happy.\nThe plant I need to reap came to me on its own.\nIt's unfortunate, but your role ends here.\"": 15,
          "\"...If you're going to regret anything.\nRegret coming here.\n...I will never let you escape.\"": 16,
          "\"Well then, let's start reaping.\"": 17,
          "\\c[18]Out of nowhere, I lost control of my body...!\n": 18,
          "\"...Ufufu. Welcome.\"": 19,
          "\"...You've taken a liking to me, haven't you...?\nI'm sure you want to enter my body as fast as possible.\nYou chased me all the way here, didn't you?\"": 20,
          "\"Or perhaps...\nthat wasn't your intention?\nFufufu...\"": 21,
          "\"...I know, everything.\nI know who helped you.\nI know I'm the best. I know everything, even you, fufu.\"": 22,
          "\"...Perfect.\nLet's end this little game of chase here.\nI was starting to get bored with it,\nBut to end it with my own hands... How lucky.\"": 23,
          "\"What a fortunate turn of events, don't you think?\"": 24,
          "\"You're strong, aren't you...\"": 25,
          "\n\\{\\{\\{\\c[30]　  \\} \\{YOU APPROACHED THE END \\}\\}\\.\\.\\^": 26,
          "NW名前指定 Risu": 27,
          "\"...It's nice to see you.\"": 28,
          "\"Fufu...\nWhy are you trembling so much?\nI came back to praise you, but you're hurting my feelings.\"": 29,
          "\"Could it be... are you shaking because it's ticklish?\n...Ufufu, I'm sorry.\nPlease bear with it for just a little longer...\"": 30,
          "\"But... you understand, don't you?\nYou can't kill me.\nNo matter how hard you try, it's impossible.\"": 31,
          "\"No matter how many times you try, I'll always come back...\nEven if you kill me, I'll be reborn from within you...\"": 32,
          "\"That said, you did manage to kill me, didn't you?\nThat itself is... worthy of some praise.\nYou're really strong.\nI've been waiting for someone like you all along.\"": 33,
          "\"But... that's it.\nYou're just a little bit strong.\nAnd that's not enough to change the world.\"": 34,
          "\"...It's quite annoying, you know?\nIf only you came a little earlier,\nit might have been a different case...\nBut right now... you're nothing but a nuisance.\"": 35,
          "\"...By the way, let's talk about that girl.\nI killed Fetus again.\nI really do love her, you know?\nBut she always seems to hate me.\"": 36,
          "\"I don't want her to grow up in a world like this.\nI think I want to be friends with her again, really...\nMaybe if we became her parents, we could get along?\"": 37,
          "\"...Fufu.\nBefore I kill you,\nI'll use your body.\"": 38,
          "\"...I'm sorry.\nI killed Fetus.\nIf we continue with the world as it is,\nShe'll be gone forever...\"": 39,
          "\"...I really do love her.\nSo... I really can't help you. I'm truly hopeless.\nI messed up twice now, with the things I really loved.\"": 40,
          "\"...Nee, could you somehow bring her here with you?\nIf you do that, I'll think twice before attacking.\n...I'm counting on you, messenger.\"": 41,
          "\"If you can do that...\nI wouldn't mind sacrificing myself, really...\"": 42,
          "\"...Nee.\nDo you think you'd be fine with dying?\nDo you think that even if you die here,\nit wouldn't truly be the end...? Is that how you feel?\"": 43,
          "\"─As I thought, it's no use.\nMy words aren't reaching you anymore, it's too late.\nFor now... could you just leave this world behind?\"": 44,
          "\"Fufu, it's fine.\nEven if you can't do anything right now,\nI'll make sure to fix the world myself...\nDon't worry, just go ahead and die for now.\"": 45,
          "\"Goodbye.\nTry to play it out differently next time.\n...May the light be there for you in the future.\"": 46,
          "『Her World』": 47,
          "\"...Did you really think everything would end\njust by killing me?\"\n": 48,
          "\"Sorry, but I won't let you do that.\"": 49,
          "\"You're the messenger sent by that person, aren't you?\"": 50,
          "\"That person doesn't send anyone without a plan.\nRight now the world is crumbling... The fact that\nthey sent you means they expect you to be able to do\nsomething about it.\"": 51,
          "\"But... you can't even beat me, it is very concerning.\nBy the way, I've already killed Fetus.\"": 52,
          "\"If I had known someone like you would come,\nI wouldn't have done that.\nBut for now, I have no reason to save the world.\nInstead, I'll make you become 'one with me.'\"": 53,
          "\"Relax and surrender.\nWe won't perish.\nEveryone will become 'one with me' and be with the\nCrimson Wrath...\"": 54,
          "\"I will take everyone into the 'New Era'.\nInstead of Maruoris...\"": 55,
          "\"If you don't like that...\nWell, if you think you can do something about it...\n...Then show me.\"": 56,
          "\"It's no use trying to act recklessly now.\nEven if your body dies,\nyou don't know what will happen to your soul...\nSo let me take care of your soul for you.\"": 57,
          "\"Fufu, you're really cute...\nInstead of Maruoris,\nI'll take you into the 'New Era.'\"": 58,
          "\"...But before that.\nThere's something I need you to do.\"": 59,
          "\"Nee, do you see it lying there?\nThat child's corpse...\nI really didn't want to do that, you know?\nBut that child kept attacking me... I had no choice.\"": 60,
          "\"I didn't want that child to grow up like that.\nI wanted to be friends with her if I could...\nMaybe if we became her parents, we could get along?\"": 61,
          "\"...Fufu.\nYour body.\nI'll use it.\"": 62,
          "Out of nowhere, I lost control of my body...!\n": 63,
          "\"Nee, you.\nCan you see the black vortex rising in the sky?\"": 64,
          "\"It's pretty small for now.\nBut it will keep growing.\nSwallowing the entire world and destroying everything.\"": 65,
          "\"I'm just waiting for it to happen.\n...At this point,\nI don't really care about anything else.\"": 66,
          "\"...Shall I make a proposal?\nIf you wish, I can die right here for you.\nIf you want a fight, I'll fight you.\n...If you don't want anything, I'll just go away.\"": 67,
          "\"And, shall I break the seal on the Umbral Basin?\nYou'll be able to fulfill your goal no matter what.\nThank you for your hard work.\"": 68,
          "\"So, what is it that you desire?\"": 69,
          "Please die": 70,
          "I want a fight": 71,
          "Break the Umbral Basin's seal ": 72,
          "I don't want anything": 73,
          "\"...Fine, I understand. Goodbye.\nIt was for a short time, but I'm happy we've met.\n...That was a lie.\nI didn't feel anything, and I'm sure I won't.\"": 74,
          "\"...Alright～.\nI don't even know what we're fighting for, though.\"": 75,
          "\"Shall we begin then?\"": 76,
          "\"Ara... You're quite strong, aren't you?\"": 77,
          "\"...Fufu.\nIt was some fun at least.\nWell then, take care...\"": 78,
          "\"Oh...\nWell, it can't be helped.\nI am strong, after all.\"": 79,
          "\"Then... I guess should I apologize?\"": 80,
          "\"...Eh?\nOh, I'm sorry,\nit's actually more tiring to keep it sealed.\nI've already undone it.\"": 81,
          "\"...I see.\nWell then, goodbye.\"": 82,
          "\"...\nNee. Can I tell you something?\"": 83,
          "\"I think I did the right thing, you know?\nI seem to have some regrets, though.\nSomehow I keep thinking I shouldn't have done this,\nI've been thinking that all along.\"": 84,
          "\"...Sigh.\nIn the end, no one earned anything in this world\"": 85,
          "\"─Really?\nAlright, I'll open the entrance to\nthe distortion for you.\"": 86,
          "\"...\nYou're accepting this rather easily, aren't you?\"": 87,
          "\"...So, what will you do next?\"": 88,
          "\"...\"": 89,
          "\"...Nee.\nYour wish has been granted, hasn't it?\nI think that blade is unnecessary now.\"": 90,
          "\"...Indeed, if I defeat Wrath, maybe the world\nwill return to peace.\nBut... Risu, I've never forgotten that you are as\ndangerous as Wrath itself!!\"": 91,
          "\"…Ara, is that so?\nI wonder how many times I've heard you say that now?\nFine. I'll kill you again.\"": 92,
          "\"It looks like your partner is here as well.\nHe seems to have rushed here for you.\"": 93,
          "\"─!!\"": 94,
          "\"\\n[1]!!\"": 95,
          "\"We meet once again, \\n[1]-san.\nAnd in a few minutes, I suppose it'll be a goodbye.\"": 96,
          "\"Can you make a... promise?\nIf Wrath is destroyed and world is finally at peace,\ncan you swear that you won't take anyone's life?\"": 97,
          "\"You're talking about a future that will never come...\nI can't make such a promise.\"": 98,
          "\"...Fufu. Nee, why don't we just stop now?\nI'm really not a bad witch, you know?\"": 99,
          "\"...Shut up!\n...Let's go, \\n[1]!!\nIf we are together, I am sure we can win!!\"": 100,
          "\"I... See...\"": 101,
          "\"...Let me tell you one last thing.\nNo matter what you do,\nIt's useless, the world is doomed to perish.\"": 102,
          "\"...Even if you challenge me again,\nand somehow manage to win... well...\"": 103,
          "\"You've become stronger, haven't you...\nAh, this makes me so sad...!\nBut, becoming strong is pointless now, isn't it...\"": 104,
          "\"—Nee, Fetus.\nDon't you realize that staying silent shows that\nyou don't know anything...?\"": 105,
          "\"...Risu.\"": 106,
          "\"...What is it?\"": 107,
          "\"...I remember everything.\"": 108,
          "\"About the day I found you.\"": 109,
          "\"The time I brought you here.\"": 110,
          "\"The days we spent playing together.\"": 111,
          "\"What you did to us...\"": 112,
          "\"...Everything. I remember everything.\"": 113,
          "\"—Ah.\"": 114,
          "\"...\\n[1].\"": 115,
          "\"...So, what's the point?\nNothing will change even if you remember.\nDoes remembering even change anything?\nYou are completely powerless.\"": 116,
          "\"...\nI want to stop you, Risu... to stop you.\"": 117,
          "\"I don't understand why you keep killing people...!!\nBut I know better than anyone that you're not the kind\nof person who would do something like that...\nUnless there's a reason, I know you the best...\"": 118,
          "\"I... I just...\nI don't want to watch you suffer in silence, Risu...\"": 119,
          "\"...Fetus.\nOur time together was long ago.\nIn fact, it's from a time far, far behind.\nI am completely different from how I was before.\"": 120,
          "\"You keep following me around every single time...\nYou're such a pain.\nEven now, just seeing you like this...\"": 121,
          "\"I...\"": 122,
          "\"...I feel so horrible.\"": 123,
          "\"...Risu.\nI love you.\"": 124,
          "\"But... that's why, I have to kill you.\"": 125,
          "\"...Why?\"": 126,
          "\"...I want to make it easier for you.\nYou've been suffering since that day,\nand now you can't go back anymore.\"": 127,
          "\"...I could never understand you.\"": 128,
          "\"Your ghost kept following me, over and over again.\nI wondered why you kept trying to kill me.\nWas it to punish me, to never forgive me?\nI wonder if your ghost will haunt me forever...?\"": 129,
          "\"I always thought that...\"\n": 130,
          "\"But now, are you... forgiving me?\"": 131,
          "\"I can't forgive you...\nThe person who so willingly took other peoples' lives.\"": 132,
          "\"You killed everyone at the orphanage, me as well.\nBut you didn't want to do that, I'm sure of it.\nThe others from the orphanage understand that too!\"": 133,
          "\"If you're still suffering from what has happened...\nIf you continue suffering and won't accept yourself...\nI want to free you from that suffering.\"": 134,
          "\"You can be forgiven, Risu.\nNo one blames you for what happened back then.\nAt least I won't... never.\"": 135,
          "\"...Even so. I don't intend to be forgiven.\"": 136,
          "\"The reason I steal everyone's faces is for them to be one with me.\nEven if the world is destroyed, I will definitely survive.\nSo, if everyone is within me, they will live on.\nThat is why I am stealing everyone's faces.\"": 137,
          "\"Nee, Fetus' partner.\"": 138,
          "NW名前指定 Risu, Pale Eternity": 139,
          "\"I'm going to give everything I've got now.\"": 140,
          "\"With all my power, I will... kill you.\"": 141,
          "\"But still... if...\"": 142,
          "\"If you can kill me,\"": 143,
          "\"I can rest easy... and entrust everything to you.\"": 144,
          "\"So... please.\"": 145,
          "\"Try to kill me.\"": 146,
          "\"And... a peaceful world.\"": 147,
          "\"Show me.\"": 148,
          "\"...I can't die here, not now.\"": 149,
          "\"Tch, if we defeat Wrath, everything will be over...\nRisu, if you want to atone for your sins...\"": 150,
          "\"...Nee, Fetus.\"": 151,
          "\"...!\"": 152,
          "\"...I love you.\"": 153,
          "\"Thank you.\"": 154,
          "\n\\{\\{\\{\\c[30] \\}\\{ DREAM IS APPROACHING ITS END\\}\\}": 155,
          "Fetus": 156,
          "Fetus - After Victory <SURLY>": 157,
          "\"Let's go into the distortion.\nThis time... we will definitely kill Dial.\"": 158,
          "\"Risu...\"": 159
        },
