          "EV005": 3,
          "NW名前指定 Arkos, Sword of Dreams": 4,
          "\"...Everyone fought on, driven by their desire for peace.\"": 5,
          "\"...But then, everyone gave up on the world's peace.\nThey were broken by the weight of their own failures...\"": 6,
          "\"...They hoped, one day, a hero would bring light to this world.\"": 7,
          "\"...This was everyone's wish.\"": 8,
          "\"...That was their only hope.\"": 9,
          "\"...And even in death.\"": 10,
          "\"...Their wishes never ceased.\"": 11,
          "\"...The time has come for everyone's wishes to come true.\"": 12,
          "\"...Messenger! Allow me to thank you, on behalf of Gwirionedd.\"": 13,
          "\"...We are all grateful to you.\"": 14,
          "\"...And we entrust everything to you.\"": 15,
