        "indexIds": {
          "EV002": 0,
          "The end has come": 1,
          "Leave": 2,
          "...Everything is being swallowed by the black vortex.": 3,
          "A blinding, scarlet light spins like a whirlpool...\nAnd slowly consumes everything.": 4,
          "The end of the world... there were no stories here.\nOnly an overwhelming force,\nEasily ripping everything apart, taking it all away.": 5,
          "...It's so anticlimactic.\nIs this how the world ends...?\nSo easily?": 6,
          "...No, perhaps it was already over.\nThis was a world that existed without a purpose.\nOnly to now collapse in such an obvious way.": 7,
          "My mission... my mission to witness the end, it ends here.\n...But was that the purpose of my mission from beginning?": 8,
          "...This is the outcome of my weakness.\nIf I were stronger, this wouldn't have been the result.": 9,
          "...No, maybe it was all hopeless from the start.\nJudging by what happened, Fetus and I probably never stood a chance\nagainst that crimson monster.": 10,
          "We would probably reach the same ending as now.\nWe would only meet the same fate, it was pointless...": 11,
          "...What lies ahead can only be eternal nothingness.": 12,
          "Ah, Fetus, I'm sorry...": 13,
          "In the end, I was powerless...\nPlease, please forgive me...\"": 14,
          "『Messenger of the End』": 15,
          "It's all over...": 16,
          "...Fetus is in the cave.\nI have to show my face to her.": 17,
          "\"...\"": 18,
          "EV003": 19,
          "...There's nothing beyond here.": 20,
          "Fetus is in the cave over there.\nI have to show my face to her.": 21,
          "EV004": 22
        },
        "indexIsBuilt": false,
        "progress": {
          "translated": 20,
          "length": 23,
          "percent": 86.95652173913044
        },
