        "indexIds": {
          "<色調 -20, -20, -20, 20>": 0,
          "EV001": 1,
          "EV002": 2,
          "\"Ah, \\n[1]...!!\nWelcome back...!!\"": 3,
          "Talk": 4,
          "\\c[22]Hug her": 5,
          "Leave": 6,
          "\"It's really all over, isn't it...?\nWith so much time left to just stare at you,\nI can't help but feel the weight of it all... Fufu.\"": 7,
          "\"...Yeah. I... I love you.\"\n": 8,
          "\"...I love you.\"": 9,
          "...": 10,
          "Stop": 11,
          "NW名前指定 Fetus": 12,
          "\"It's really... all over, isn't it...?\"": 13,
          "Ah.\nYes, it's all over...": 14,
          "\"With so much time left to just stare at you,\nI can't help but feel the weight of it all... Fufu.\"": 15,
          "...Yeah, I suppose.": 16,
          "─No.": 17,
          "No!!!": 18,
          "Ah, Fetus...\nWhy...?\nWhy is this happening again...?!": 19,
          "It should've been over...!\nWe were supposed to end it all, with our own hands...!!??": 20,
          "...It's not over.\nIt's not over! It's not over!\nIt's NOT OVER!!!": 21,
          "This is where it begins...!!!\nEverything was supposed to start anew!!!!": 22,
          "Why, Fetus...!! You weren't supposed to be like this...!!\nWhy do you keep whispering the same thing...!!!\nPlease... Fetus...!!\nYou must be able to hear me!?": 23,
          "I... I can't take it anymore...!!!": 24,
          "I can't...!!!": 25,
          "Fetus...!!!": 26,
          "...Ah, I love you too!!!\nI thought we would walk this world together from now on!!!\nI have no memory of it, but... I thought we would be together again,\nas your partner, your companion...!!!": 27,
          "Please... can you hear me...?\nPlease, Fetus, Fetus...!\nPlease, save me, I have nowhere to go...!": 28,
          "...What is happening?": 29,
          "...This is a lie, right?\nWait, what is this? What's going on here!?\nCould it... be... the world is ending!?": 30,
          "─No!!!\nWe were supposed to save the world!!!\nWe... we took the future into our own hands!!!": 31,
          "Aaaaah... please, don't let it end like this...!!\nWhy is this happening...!?\nEverything was going right...!!!": 32,
          "Please... Fetus, answer me...!!!\nThis ending, it's wrong, isn't it!?": 33,
          "Please, Fetus!! Answer me!!!": 34,
          "\n　　　　　　 　　 　　　　　　THE END": 35,
          "\\c[27]Hug her": 36,
          "\"...So, it's really all over, huh?\nNo... maybe, with this, it has finally begun...?\"": 37,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 38,
          "\"Ah...\"": 39,
          "...\\! I've always been so lonely...": 40,
          "\"...\"": 41,
          "No one could hear my words...": 42,
          "No matter what I did, I couldn't get a response...": 43,
          "Even though you're right here...\nMy voice, my touch... they never reached you...!!": 44,
          "...Hey, Fetus.\n...Can you hear me?": 45,
          "Please... if you can hear me, answer me...": 46,
          "\"...It's okay \\n[1]. I can hear you.\"": 47,
          "\"I can hear your voice... feel your warmth...\"": 48,
          "\"...It's okay.\"": 49,
          "\"I can feel it all...\"": 50,
          "\"So... Fufu.\"": 51,
          "\"Don't cry so much.\"": 52,
          "\"From now on... We'll always be together...\"": 53,
          "\"So... let's slowly, step by step, move forward...\"": 54,
          "\"To our future...\"": 55,
          "\"...Ah, \\n[1]. Did you wake up?\"": 56,
          "\"...Are you heading out already?\nIt's so early... maybe stay a little longer—\n...No, you're right. Let's go.\"": 57,
          "\"...But it's going to be okay.\nMy adventure story... It was long, so long.\nThe places I need to go to aren't just one or two.\nThere's definitely someone, somewhere――\"": 58,
          "\"...Ah!\nNee, \\n[1]... Look...\"": 59,
          "\"It's beautiful...\\! It's dawn.\"": 60
        },
        "indexIsBuilt": false,
        "progress": {
          "translated": 56,
          "length": 61,
          "percent": 91.80327868852459
        },
        "cellInfo": []
      },
