        "indexIds": {
          "Gwirionedd Orphanage": 0,
          "<色調 -50, -50, -50, 0>\r\n<マップ名Orphanage >": 1,
          "EV001": 2,
          "EV002": 3,
          "EV003<SURLY>": 4,
          "...Wonderful.\nYou have obtained the future you desired.\nWrath has been released, the dream has ended...\nand you've gained your freedom.": 5,
          "But that's not all.\nYou... saved me.": 6,
          "Fufu... Fufufufu...\nI wonder, why is that...?\n...I was supposed to vanish with the dream.\nBut nothing has changed; I am still myself.": 7,
          "If there's one thing different...\n\nIt seems my voice... is clearly reaching you now.": 8,
          "...But still, I am not free.\n...Strange. I am still in a dream.\nThe dream should have ended because of you, yet...\nIt feels as though it still exists, somewhere within.": 9,
          "Hey,\nWould you mind... saving me from this dream?\n...Deep and dark. The bottom of this dream.\nPlease, save me from this fate, I beg you.": 10,
          "...I'm sure you will, without needing to be told, won't you?\n\nI'll be waiting, my dear, dear child...": 11,
          "Rebirth.": 12,
          "The name of chaos rooted in his body.": 13,
          "His lives carrying time and memory.": 14,
          "Death and lives overlapping in all things.": 15,
          "What I seek is his time. His memories.": 16,
          "As I wish. As I desire, until it is fulfilled.": 17,
          "I shall devour all dreams.": 18,
          "And once more, we shall meet at the beginning─": 19,
          "\\c[10]Touch the crystal": 20,
          "Pull your hand away": 21,
          "\\c[10] ※ If you touch that crystal,\nall NPCs in here, except for Fetus, will disappear.\nThere will be nothing in return.": 22,
          "\\c[10] ※ If you touch that crystal,\nall NPCs in here, except for Fetus, will disappear.\nThere will be nothing in return.\n\\c[18]Are you sure you want to touch the crystal?": 23,
          "The flowers are blooming in death.": 24,
          "Everything is granted to us by our mother.": 25,
          "An irreplaceable miracle.": 26,
          "Given to us by our mother─": 27,
          "An irreplaceable, power...": 28,
          "\"Village Girl\"": 29,
          "\"My memories are disappearing...\"": 30,
          "\"Raisdell\"": 31,
          "\"Elcis\"": 32,
          "\"Merchant Yun\"": 33,
          "\"Rifell\"": 34,
          "EV004": 35,
          "EV005": 36,
          "EV006": 37,
          "EV007": 38,
          "EV008": 39,
          "EV009": 40,
          "EV010": 41,
          "EV011": 42,
          "EV012": 43,
          "EV013": 44,
          "EV014": 45,
          "EV015": 46,
          "EV016": 47,
          "EV017": 48,
          "EV018": 49
        },
