        "indexIds": {
          "Pale Village": 0,
          "<マップ名Pale_Village >\r\n<色調 20, 20, 20, 30>\r\n==マップフォグ日差し[0,0,100,150,1]==": 1,
          "EV008": 2,
          "EV009": 3,
          "EV001": 4,
          "EV002": 5,
          "EV003": 6,
          "EV004": 7,
          "EV005": 8,
          "EV006": 9,
          "Fetus": 10,
          "\"...Nee.\\!\nCould you come closer?\"": 11,
          "NW名前指定 Fetus": 12,
          "\"...A long time ago,\nThis country used to be full of magical beasts.\"": 13,
          "\"Arkos and the others defeated many magical beasts,\nturning this place into a safer area.\\!\nAnd then... I thought it'd be nice to go on little adventures.\nI went with Risu and the children from the orphanage.\"": 14,
          "\"If I told my mother, she'd scold me, so...\nI snuck out. See?\nRight around there... Fufu, you see? It's all clear now, right?\\!\nWe'd pass through the forest, excited to see what we'd find.\"": 15,
          "\"Then... I met Melf-chan!\\!\nWhen I introduced Melf-chan to my mother,\nshe found out we'd been playing in the forest,\nso she would get a little mad at me.\"": 16,
          "\"After that, I started going to Melf-chan's garden almost every day.\\!\nWe played hide and seek in the flower fields, rode on the back of\nUnwild, and ate cakes for snacks...\\!\nWe would even play with Maruoris sometimes.\"": 17,
          "\"We played a lot... and on some days we'd tire ourselves out,\nwhile on the other days we wouldn't have enough fun.\\!\nBut when evening came, no matter how hard it was to say goodbye,\nI'd wave and leave the garden, heading back to the orphanage.\"": 18,
          "\"But, you know, I was so used to those small everyday things.\nNo matter what, after I came back, dinner still wouldn't be ready.\\!\nSo, we all had to wait.\"": 19,
          "\"...The time I had to wait until dinner was ready, was weird.\nIt was a quiet, dim, lonely time where I had to just sit and wait.\"": 20,
          "\"...I sat there the whole time.\"": 21,
          "\"Sometimes, I'd hear the insects chirping...\\!\nSometimes, only the howling of the wind would echo...\nSometimes I'd talk with Risu, or Hela would sit next to me...\\!\nSyvthiedy would tease me... but in the end, food would be ready.\"": 22,
          "\"Those times were a little lonely, but I loved them.\nAnd it always lasted until my mother would call us to eat...\nI always felt how quickly time flew in that place.\"": 23,
          "\"...Those moments will never come back, however...\nWhen I sit here, I get the feeling that,\njust for a moment, I'm back in that time...\"": 24,
          "\"...I wonder, if I close and open my eyes, will I be back there?\nI wish I could take you there...\"": 25,
          "EV010": 26,
          "未来の生存NPC追加：\n一度生存が確定したNPCは、未来では永続的に生存する。\n（移動前のリフェルを除く）": 27,
          "レイスデル：貌虚天との戦闘が可能な周回において、\n特殊イベントが進行可能。\nその際に獲得できる『レイスデルの夢』の所持の有無で判定。\n+１": 28,
          "荒れ野の少女：この移動時、\n貌虚天を倒した状態で荒れ野の少女が生存しているかで判定。\n+１": 29,
          "エルシス：エルシスイベント完遂時に獲得する『エルシスの夢』の有無\norエルシス生存中で判定。\n+１": 30,
          "ユン：この移動時、\n貌虚天を倒した状態でユンが生存しているかで判定。\n+１": 31,
          "リフェル：殉教墓地前……生存状態で判定。\n荒れ野の村への移動……ディアル戦時、リフェルを救出。\nその際に獲得する『リフェルの夢』の有無で判定。\n+１": 32,
          "レイド：イベントを最終まで進めた証を所持しているかで判定。": 33,
          "EV011": 34,
          "EV012": 35
        },
        "indexIsBuilt": false,
        "progress": {
          "translated": 16,
          "length": 36,
          "percent": 44.44444444444444
        },
        "cellInfo": []
      },
