        "indexIds": {
          "<色調 20, 20, 20, 30>\r\n==マップフォグ日差し[0,0,100,200,1]==\r\n<マップ名Crossroads >": 0,
          "EV024": 1,
          "EV026": 2,
          "EV015": 3,
          "EV016": 4,
          "EV017": 5,
          "EV018": 6,
          "EV019": 7,
          "EV001": 8,
          "EV002": 9,
          "EV003": 10,
          "EV004": 11,
          "EV005": 12,
          "EV006": 13,
          "EV007": 14,
          "EV008": 15,
          "\"....My head hurts...\"": 16,
          "\"Ah, it's you...\n...You?\nHave we met somewhere before?\"": 17,
          "\"Ah, it's you...\n...You?\nHave we met somewhere before?\nWhatever, it is probably just a coincidence...\"": 18,
          "\"...Hah.\nI don't remember, but... Could it be... No, it couldn't be...\nTo think that a world of madness and fear could end...\nWhat the hell happened...?\"": 19,
          "Talk": 20,
          "Leave": 21,
          "\"I...\nThat half-dragon girl...\nI thought I was finished after she stabbed me...\"": 22,
          "\"When I woke up, it was...\nWell, here I am.\nI feel pathetic for not being able to avenge that person...\nWho in the world... saved me?\"": 23,
          "\"...From now on, huh?\nWhat should I do... I'll take my time thinking it through...\"": 24,
          "\"As for the Martyrdom Cemetery, they're taking good care of it.\nWe had many followers of the sword among us,\nthough most of them ended up inside a monster's belly...\"": 25,
          "\"...\nOnce this headache is gone, I guess I'll help out too...\"": 26,
          "\"...What's going on... My vision's all blurry...\nSorry, I need to be alone for a bit...\nI'm feeling really sick...\"": 27,
          "\".....\"": 28,
          "\"...Hey, you.\nCan I ask you one last thing...?\"": 29,
          "\"The eyes are within us.\nYou didn't notice what has started and that which hasn't ended.\nThat what has begun. The eyes are laughing.\nYou ended everything and started it. You are the one who began it.\"": 30,
          "\"It can't end. It can't end. It will continue forever, forever.\nYou, started everything again. \\}Again\\{, again, again, again.\nYou made it all begin. The endless beginning, one, two, three, four\nthe eyes, our eyes, everyone's eyes. Don't you understand yet?\"": 31,
          "\\{\\{\\{\\{\\{ \"We are the Eye Hunters──\\.\\^": 32,
          "\\{\\{\\{ \"You...\\! Have saved no one──\\.\\.\\^": 33,
          "EV009": 34,
          "\"...! Ah it's... the Hero-sama...\nI have witnessed your heroic figure...\nIn the sky of the black vortex... I saw your shining\nsword that pierced it... I witnessed it...\"": 35,
          "\"...Hundreds of years. We, the followers of the sword,\nsought to eradicate the Crimson Wrath...\nWe challenged them... only to be hopelessly scattered.\"": 36,
          "\"Those souls...\nAnd the soul of our master, Arkos-sama...\nThanks to you, their souls have been saved...\nOn behalf of everyone, I thank you...\"": 37,
          "\"...If there is anything, anything at all, I can do,\nplease, tell me. Though I am unworthy,\nI will do everything I can...\"": 38,
          "\"These graves... built by the Crimson Demon's...\nThey had no intention of offering any memorials,\nbut even if that's the case these graves are undeniably\nthe graves of our faithful followers...\"": 39,
          "\"...\"": 40,
          "\"...Umm, Hero-sama.\nIf you happen to come across a girl with black hair\nand purple eyes, could you please tell me...?\nShe is my younger sister...\"": 41
        },
