        "indexIds": {
          "<色調 20, 20, 20, 30>\r\n<マップ名The_Village >": 0,
          "The Village": 1,
          "EV014": 2,
          "NW名前指定 Merchant Yun": 3,
          "\"Hey there, onii-san.\nBeen ages, huh? How've you been?\nMan, you were seriously impressive back then!\nAll shining brightly and stuff, you know what I mean?\"": 4,
          "Talk": 5,
          "Elcis' troubles if(s[331])": 6,
          "\\c[27]Can you become my girlfriend? if(s[987] == false)": 7,
          "Leave": 8,
          "\"Hey, onii-san.\nYou still haven't seen Elcis, huh?\n...Hmm, that's pretty inconsiderate of him you know.\nLeaving your dear onee-chan all alone like that.\"": 9,
          "\"...Think he really died for real this time?\n...Nah, no way. He'll be fine.\nI'm honestly ridiculously worried about him,\nbut he always pops back up eventually.\"": 10,
          "\"Elcis used to say his older sister was stubborn,\nbut honestly, the real stubborn one was him.\"": 11,
          "\"...So, absolutely, without a doubt,\nhe'll just suddenly show up out of nowhere one day.\nStill, onii-san, if you see him, let me know, yeah?\nWorrying's just... exhausting, you know?\"": 12,
          "\"Oh, if by some awful chance you find him... uh, dead.\nCould you bring his body to me or at least let me know?\nI'd want to make him a proper grave.\"": 13,
          "\"Oh, and Elcis told me something once...\nWhat was it again? Oh yeah, magical beasts.\nYou know about them, right, onii-san?\nApparently, Obetion had a problem with them before.\"": 14,
          "\"His ancestors? Total legends. They took down the\nleader of those beasts, Or so the story goes...\nBut expecting Elcis to pull off the same kind of feat?\nYeah, that's a bit too much. It's just Elcis after all.\"": 15,
          "\"Ah... Oh yeah, remember how he used to get mistaken\nFor some descendant of Lord Arkos? All because of that\nheirloom sword. People treated him like royalty!\nNostalgic.\"": 16,
          "\"Huh, what?\nElcis is struggling because I can't find a guy?\nElcis was venting to you about that, huh, onii-san?\nAhahaha!!\"": 17,
          "\"Hey, listen up, onii-san.\nYou wouldn't believe how many times he's told me that.\nIt's so annoying, so I finally said to him:\n'Well, how about having a child with your sister?'\"": 18,
          "\"And you know what he did? He was all,\n'W-wha!? Th-that's... uh, impossible, no way!!\"\nAhaha!\"": 19,
          "\"Oh man, it's so funny every time I think about it.\nI've never seen him that flustered before!\"": 20,
          "\"...Haha. So, onii-san,\nwhat about you? Wanna have a kid with me?\n...Nah. Nah, forget I said that. Definitely not.\"": 21,
          "\"It's not like I haven't thought about it, though.\nBut honestly? It'd have to wait until...\nWell, until things settle down a bit.\nThere's just too much going on right now.\"": 22,
          "\"So, what do you think, onii-san?\nCan I... 'reserve' you for later?\nAh, but I guess you're super busy too, right?\nHeroes like you have it rough.\"": 23,
          "\"...Oh? Not really?\n...Mostly alone, huh?\n\n...Really?\"": 24,
          "\"Onii-san, why are you wasting your cum like that...?\n\nWhat a waste....\"": 25,
          "This feels awfully familiar...\n\n\\c[8]Would you like to experience the event again?": 26,
          "Yes": 27,
          "No": 28,
          "\"...Huh?\n\nOh, onii-san, is that what you're here for?\"": 29,
          "\"...Pffft.\nAw, what a shame~.\nTo think you were that kind of person, onii-san~.\"": 30,
          "\"...Hmm, let's see.\nIf you stripped down and laid right here, right now,\nMaybe I'd think about it?\"": 31,
          "\"...Uh... \\!Huh? Wait.\nDid I mishear something just now?\nWhat did you just say, onii-san~?\"": 32,
          "\"...Ohhh. I see. So that's it. That's why.\nOnii-san's got a lot of confidence, doesn't he?\nBut hey, I guess it makes sense.\nYou're the hero who saved the world, right?\"": 33,
          "\"Ah, well, at least you're not forcing me.\nI guess that's something to be proud of, haha!\nAlright, fine. I'll do it for you, onii-san.\nNow, go ahead, strip, and lie down.\"": 34,
          "EV001": 35,
          "EV002": 36,
          "NW名前指定 Rifell": 37,
          "\"─Ah...\n\\n[1]-sama...\"": 38,
          "\"....\nIt's been a long time...\"": 39,
          "\\c[27]Something feels off.... if(s[987] == false)": 40,
          "\"If I stay near you,\nFetus-sama would be pretty angry after all...\"": 41,
          "\"What's wrong, Rifell?\nIf I may say so, you seem unusually shy.\nIt's not like you at all...\nDid something happen while I was away?\"": 42,
          "\"...No.\n...Nothing happened.\"": 43,
          "\"...Where is Fetus-sama...?\"": 44,
          "\"Ah, Fetus is at the orphanage right now.\nShe said she wanted to stay a little longer,\nso I came here to check in on the village first.\"": 45,
          "\"If that's the case, then this is a lot worse, isn't it!?\nTo leave behind the one you love, and come... To me...\"": 46,
          "\"U-uhm. So that's what's bothering you.\nBut it would've been rude not to stop by.\nYou are an important comrade,\nand it's only right that I pay a visit.\"": 47,
          "\"...A comrade!\n─Yes, of course...\n...\"": 48,
          "\"H-hey. Are you okay?\n...You're burning up, do you have a fever or something!\nDid you fall ill or something?\"": 49,
          "\"...\\n[1]-sama.\"": 50,
          "\"Rifell, wait!\nIf you're feeling sick, you should lie down—\"": 51,
          "\"\\n[1]-sama...!\"": 52,
          "\"R-Rifell?!\" \\.\\^": 53,
          "\"\\n[1]-sama...!!\" \\.\\^": 54
        },
        "indexIsBuilt": false,
