          "EV011": 14,
          "\"Fuuuuuu...\nAh, our Mother... our Mother's Mother...\nAt last, You have...!! At last, finally grasped it....!!!\nYour true self...!!!\"": 15,
          "\"Guhi...!!\nGuHyahahahahaha!! Ahahahahahahahaha...!!!\n...Twice. Twice, I have been granted life.\nAnd twice, I have felt happiness from the bottom of my heart...\"": 16,
          "\"The first was the moment I received this life from our Mother...\nAnd now... Now, in this very moment!!!!\nI feel the greatest, most unparalleled joy!!!!\nTo witness the fulfillment of your… Your dearest wish……!!!": 17,
          "\"Hihi...!!!\nHihyahya!!! GuHyahahahahahahahahahaha!!!!\nAaaaaahhahahaha... Ahhhhh... I'm so happy...\"": 18,
          "\"Oh my, my, isn't this a surprise!! You're still alive too, huh?!\nWe've both survived, it seems...!!\nIn this world that will do nothing but rot away...!!\nAhahahah!! Hah!! Hahahahahah!!!\"": 19,
          "Talk": 20,
          "\\c[10]Kill if(s[390] && !s[390]))": 21,
          "Leave": 22,
          "\"Hey, do you know...?? About the tale of the Abyssal Dream...?!\nThe black vortex, you know... It disappeared, didn't it...???\nAnd then they all died, every last one of them...!!!\nWhy, I wonder...?! So strange, isn't it...?!?!\"": 23,
          "\"Those guys who made such a fuss about immortality...!!!!!\nAll of them, dead in an instant...!!!! Hihi...!!\nIsn't that just pitiful...?! Why did it happen...?!\nThey finally managed to become immortal, and yet...!!!!\"": 24,
          "\"─Hey, who was it???\nWho wiped out the Crimson Wrath's Vortex...?!\nWho's the heartless bastard that did it...?!\nWhoever it is, I... I'll...!!!\"": 25,
          "\"─I'll kill them where they stand!!!!\nAhaha!! Ahahahahahahahah!!!! Ahhahahahahaha!!!\nCome on, who is it!!!??? Who destroyed the vortex!!!??\nWho killed the dark one's, who in the hell was it!!!???\"": 26,
          "\"Tell me, damn it!!! I'll slaughter them with my own hands!!!\n─Ahahahah!!! Ahaha!! Gyahaha!!\nGyahahahahahahah!!! Hiiii-hihihihihihihihihi!!!!\nGyahahahahahahahahahahahahaha!!!!!!!!!\"": 27,
          "\"─Hihi...!! No, no... maybe it's not that, huh...??\n...Yeah, that's it, Maruoris is the one to blame, I suppose...??\nBecause of his shady promises of immortality,\neveryone ended up dead...\"": 28,
          "\"I mean, what even is immortality...? Isn't it blasphemy...?!\nA blasphemy against life itself, so beautiful, so miraculous!!\nAn endless violation of the miracle our Mother bestowed upon us!!!\"": 29,
          "\"Hey, what do you think...?? Who's really to blame?\nThe one who destroyed that hopeful paradise of immortality...\nOr Maruoris, who paid the price for his blasphemy...?\"": 30,
          "\"...Haaaaa...\nOur Mother, and Her Mother...\nWhere... Where have you gone...?\nEven now, I can feel You... Within this miracle bestowed upon me.\"": 31,
          "\"...\nOh, it's you...\nWhat, are you here to kill me...?\"": 32,
          "\"Hey, you... Let's not do that now, alright?\n...Let's celebrate together.\nOur Mother's Mother has finally...\nEmbraced her perfect child in her arms...\"": 33,
          "\"Our Mother... look upon us...\nOur Mother... Has finally fulfilled her greatest wish...!\nCan You see, clearness of the sky from here...?\nThis world is truly... magnificent...!\"": 34,
          "\"Hey, you...?\nEven though the world is so beautiful like this...\nWhy do you look so miserable...?\"": 35
        },
