        "indexIds": {
          "<マップ名Mending_Swarm >\r\n<色調 -20, -20, -20, 0>\r\n[RSW:3,333]": 0,
          "EV001": 1,
          "EV002": 2,
          "EV003": 3,
          "EV004": 4,
          "\"...\\! Is that you?\"": 5,
          "NW名前指定 Raisdell ": 6,
          "\"...\n...It's been a while.\"": 7,
          "\"...\\! The extermination of the Crimson Wrath... Well done.\\!\nThrough the insects, I sensed the countless beings within you...\"": 8,
          "\"...I saw things I didn't want to, though...!\nI saw everything you did with my body...\n...You idiot.\"": 9,
          "\"But thanks to you, I have come to know what peace truly is.\nAfter you destroyed the Crimson Wrath,\nthe insects within me also calmed down for a while.\"": 10,
          "\"...I thank you.\nI'm glad you returned to see me.\nI wanted to see your face one more time.\"": 11,
          "EV005<SURLY>": 12,
          "\"...Hey. Hello.\"": 13,
          "Talk": 14,
          "\\c[27]Before the end... if(!s[987] && s[335])": 15,
          "Leave": 16,
          "\"...Say,\nif you don't mind, would you share an embrace with me?\"": 17,
          "\"...You are so warm.\nTruly...\"": 18,
          "\"...I am terrified.\nThe insects inside me that lived with me for so long...\nfor a while now, they have been very... scary...\"": 19,
          "\"I do not know when, but soon...\nmy body will be devoured by the insects.\nI can feel it. The insects grow more mad every day...\nChanging into something that is no longer just insects.\"": 20,
          "\"...Your insects seems to be quite comfortable.\nBut then... I, the one who gave you the insects,\nwill be hated and devoured by them. How ironic, haha...\"": 21,
          "\"...Or perhaps,\nI should not have met with that guy after all...\"": 22,
          "\"If you can, can you stay a little longer...?\"": 23,
          "This feels awfully familiar...\n\n\\c[8]Would you like to experience the event again?": 24,
          "Yes": 25,
          "No": 26,
          "\"...Hey.\nWill you grant my wish?\"": 27,
          "\"...In the end,\nI wish to become one with you, at least for once.\"": 28,
          "\"...If you don't mind, I want you to hold me.\nI want to understand the joy of living...\nWhat love truly is...\"": 29,
          "\"Ah, my dear...\nLet us unite, to our hearts' content...": 30
        },
