            "",
            "Благословение красной куклы"
          ],
          [
            "Consumes 6 Red Dolls to instantly restore 30% HP.                        （\\c[27]クールタイム:20\\c[\\v[290]]）\r\nThe dolls held the love of lost children all over the world.",
