          "Twin Shrouds and Mist": 35,
          "Withered One": 36,
          "Forgotten One": 37,
          "Forgotten and Mist": 38,
          "Fetus": 39,
          "\"I'll make sure to put you to rest.\nSo that, maybe, next time we can meet in a world that\nis at peace...\"\n": 40,
          "ネームウィンドウ on": 41,
          "Runaway, Tan Fernig": 42,
          "\"Run... Run away...!! It's coming... It's coming...!!\nThat terrifying crimson monster...!!\"": 43,
          "\"Why... why are you trying to kill me too...?!\nWhy won't anyone try to save me...?! Why...!!\"": 44,
          "\"Ugh...! I... I'm just...!! You'll find out too.\"\n": 45,
          "\"I'll show you what it feels like... to be killed...!!\"": 46,
          "NW名前指定 Runaway, Tan Fernig": 47,
          "\"Is it me...? Am I... Am I the one...?\"": 48,
          "Plague Worm": 49,
          "Strike from Behind!": 50,
          "Corpse Bug": 51,
          "Plague Jade Visage": 52,
          "Festering Lion": 53,
          "Corpse Bug*2": 54,
          "Plague Jade Visage*2": 55,
          "Plague Jade Visage*3": 56,
          "Preceptor Tarian": 57,
          "Follower*1": 58,
          "Disciple*1": 59,
          "Nameless Sorcerer": 60,
          "Sorcerer*2": 61,
          "Bradur": 62,
          "NW名前指定 Eye Hunter Bradur": 63,
          "\"Ah, you've finished your final prayers,\nI see. Now, allow me to claim those beautiful eyes of yours...\"": 64,
          "\"You're shaking so much, you're scared, aren't you?\nOr do you enjoy the pain? Hahaha...\"": 65,
          "\"Loyal dog, what awaits you after all your suffering?\nIf you live and die for loyalty...\nThen follow the same path as your master! Hahahahaha...!!\"": 66,
          "\"You've already been granted favor, haven't you?\n...Why, then, do you smell like a living person?\"": 67,
          "\"Aaaah! You miserable wretch!\nYou're unworthy of being a part in this new era!!!\"": 68,
          "Dokugamori*​1": 69,
          "Tegu*1": 70,
          "Martyr*1": 71,
          "Serpent Body*1": 72,
          "Ancient Sage": 73,
          "Martyr*1, Tegu*1": 74,
          "Radiant Butterfly": 75,
          "Larva": 76,
          "Cockroach": 77,
          "Swamp Scavenger": 78,
          "Kiseju": 79,
          "Kmaarikir": 80,
          "Raisdell": 81,
          "\"...Haha. Seems everyone can hardly wait.\nBut you have to understand you see. You smell irresistible...\"": 82,
          "NW名前指定 Insect Girl Raisdell ": 83,
          "\"Haah... it's so exciting...\"": 84,
          "Unwild": 85,
          "Corpse*2": 86,
          "Fallen (Yellow)*1": 87,
          "Writhing Blasphemy": 88,
          "Rabbit*2": 89,
          "Miracle Slime": 90,
          "Pigeon*2": 91,
          "Pigeon*1": 92,
          "Fallen (Red)*1": 93,
          "Fallen (Green)*1": 94,
          "Fallen Three Brothers": 95,
          "Saluf": 96,
          "\"...Nightfall's Grip.\"": 97,
          "\"...This is the first time I can help you like this.\nLet's go, \\n[1], we'll take him down in one go!\"": 98,
          "\"I was never meant to be born...\nThe happiness of others, the joy of others, the love of others.\nI sought them, and thus, I was cursed...\"": 99,
          "\"Ah, how long has it been since I've regretted something so much?\nThis unrelenting pain truly is the purpose of my existence...\"": 100,
          "\"...Please.\"": 101,
          "\"End it.\"": 102,
          "\"End it please...\"": 103,
          "\"At last... finally...\"": 104,
          "Plagued Mud*3": 105,
          "Toxin Eater*1": 106,
          "Winged Insect*2": 107,
          "Fallen Child": 108,
          "\"Come on, Deenbah! You should greet properly, like I taught you.\nFirst, bow your head and say 'Nice to meet you,' okay?\"": 109,
          "\"My, what an annoying child you are!!\nYour type deserves to have their arms ripped right off!\"": 110,
          "\"Is this how we're supposed to be? Isn't this scary??\"": 111,
          "\"Eat him.\"": 112,
          "\"Fenu! Look, Deenbah is trembling with fear!!\nLet's show them how it's done!\"": 113,
          "\"Nice to meet you, I'm Gwart! Pleased to meet you really!!\nLet's start the party with blowing you into thousand pieces!!\"": 114,
          "\"Wooah! Gwart! How cruel!\"": 115,
          "\"That's the best way to get along! By enjoying partying together!!\nIsn't it fun!? Watching the blood, the entrails, all spill out!?\"": 116,
          "\"Isn't that scary? Seriously, why're you such an abnormal person???\"": 117,
          "\\>\"Pee-hee-ro-lo-lo-lo-lo!\" \\^": 118,
          "\\>\"Slurp slurp slurp slurp\" \\^": 119,
          "\\>\"Why are we talking! Hey, looks like that person can bleed!\" \\^": 120,
          "\\>\"Eat him\" \\^": 121,
          "\\>\"Ugh, you don't like it, huh? Ugly, isn't it?\" \\^": 122,
          "\\>\"Shut up, shut up!\" \\^": 123,
          "\"Ahh-hahaha, hahaha, hahaha, hahaha, hahaha...!!!\"": 124,
          "\"Hey, hey, everyone, do you think we're actually gonna die here?\"": 125,
          "\"Are you kidding me?! We're definitely gonna die!\nI don't want to! Help me, Gwart!!\"": 126,
          "\"Is this painful?? You're bleeding, huh??\"": 127,
          "\"Ah, seriously, why is this happening...?\nDidn't we all gather here, saying we didn't want to die anymore?\"": 128,
          "\"I can't take it!! I hate Maruoris! I hate this too!!\nPlease, don't kill meeee!!!\"": 129,
          "\"EAT HIMMM!!!!\"": 130,
          "\"Is it over already? Bit too quick, wasn't it??\"": 131,
          "\\>\"Slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp\" \\^": 132,
          "\\>\"I don't want to die, no no no no no no no no no no no no noooo!!!\" \\^": 133,
          "\\>\"You're gonna die, hey, what will you do? What are you gonna do, huh?\" \\^": 134,
          "\\>\"Do you wanna die? You ready for that~?\" \\^": 135,
          "\\>\"Slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp slurp!!!!\" \\^": 136,
          "\\>\"EAT HIMMMM! EAT HIMMMM! \\^": 137,
          "\\>\"Kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill!!!\" \\^": 138,
          "\\>\"Pee-hee-ro-lo-lo-lo-lo-lo-lo-lo-looo!!!!\" \\^": 139,
          "\\>\"I DONT WANT TO DIE!!!\" \\^": 140,
          "\"─DAD! HELP MEEEE!!!\"": 141,
          "\"...Deenbah?\"": 142,
          "\"...Alright.\"": 143,
          "\\{\\{\\{\\c[18]\"I'LL FUCKING KILL YOUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUU\nUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUU\nUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUU!": 144,
          "Remnants*2": 145,
          "Failed Experiment*1": 146,
          "Eye Hunter*1": 147,
          "Mire Worm*2": 148,
          "Remnants*1, Mire Worm*1": 149,
          "Messenger of the End": 150,
          "\"The world will end.\"": 151,
          "\"Everything will end.\"": 152,
          "\"I can no longer see the light of hope.\"": 153,
          "\"...As long as there remains a beating heart.\"": 154,
          "\"...Yes, as long as our hearts beat, there is no end.\"": 155,
          "\"So long as the world endures, it will never fully end.\"": 156,
          "\"...Our dreams. They'll last forever.\"": 157,
          "\"...Ah, can you see the light there?\"": 158,
          "\"Only deep, deep darkness.\"": 159,
          "\"Even if the light is not yet visible, I must walk to make it so.\"": 160,
          "\"...I will serve you, until the last moment.\"": 161,
          "\"Now, if I may... can I be the one to take your place?\"": 162,
          "\"Pile up corpses. Build the foundation.\"": 163,
          "\"If it's shielded by the light ahead,\nthen I have no regrets, not for any sin!\"": 164,
          "Stray Undead*2": 165,
          "Foreboding Darkness": 166,
          "Man-Eating Monster": 167,
          "Residents*2": 168,
          "Fragment of a Mage": 169,
          "Valley": 170,
          "NW名前指定 Eye Hunter Valley": 171,
          "\"What do you wish to see with those eyes of yours...?\nCould you perhaps be ensnared by some foolish curiosity...?\"": 172,
          "\"...What have you seen with those eyes of yours?\nWhat have you seen having received favor?\nWhat is it that reflects in your eyes now?\"": 173,
          "\"...It has to be done. It must be sealed.\nIt must never see.\nIt must never be forgiven.\"": 174,
          "\"Ah... our will, far too heavy, and far too great...\"": 175,
          "\"Your eyes. They whisper to us...\nAnger, pride, admonition...\"": 176,
          "\"But you, tell me...\nWhy is it that, within those eyes of yours,\nI can still see traces of compassion?\"": 177,
          "Foreboding Darkness*2": 178,
          "Stray Undead*1": 179,
          "Fragment of a Mage*2": 180,
          "Mechanical Knight": 181,
          "Familiar": 182,
          "Snow Mage": 183,
          "Dark Mage*1, Familiar*1": 184,
          "Mirror Image": 185,
          "Crediur": 186,
          "NW名前指定 Sorcerer Crediur": 187,
          "\"Let us forget this brief incident entirely.\nSo, dear guest... please, return.\nI cannot allow blood to be spilled unnecessarily.\"": 188,
          "\"Haah... haah... it hurts...\"": 189,
          "\"I am no longer someone who'll simply run away...\nNor someone who'll continue to tremble and hide...!\"": 190,
          "\"...I must protect it.\nWe made a promise, didn't we...?\nMaruoris-sama...?\"": 191,
          "\\c[10]\"...Power of the Crimson Wrath.\"": 192,
          "\\c[10]\"─No more!!!\\!\nSTOP TAKING AWAY EVERYTHING I HAVE!!!\nAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!!!!!!!\"": 193,
          "A whirlpool of corruption begins to appear...\n\n\\c[2]It has become impossible to escape.": 194,
          "Mechanical Knight*2": 195,
          "Familiar*2": 196,
          "Dark Sorcerer*1": 197,
          "Clockwork Knight, Markov": 198,
          "\"Y-You... you plan to lay a hand on Lord Crediul!?\nI won't let you, I won't let you!!\"": 199,
          "\"Uwaaaa, I knew I couldn't do this alone!! It's an emergency!!\nSomeone, please, help me!!\"": 200,
          "\"U... u... WAAAAHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!\"": 201,
          "Stardust*1": 202,
          "Crystal*1": 203,
          "The Remains*2": 204,
          "マルオロイス": 205,
          "\"Ugh... Marurois... you... you...\"": 206,
          "NW名前指定 Maruoris, The Abyssal Dream": 207,
          "\"...Fetus? Am I... in a dream...?\"": 208,
          "\"...It seems this is not a dream.\"": 209,
          "\"How much time has passed...?\nThis threat of the end. It's not something new.\nThere's always been a foe, ready to distort the natural world.\nAnd there's always been someone, ready to thwart them.\"": 210,
          "\"...In the end, I couldn't do anything.\"": 211,
          "\"Now, through this 'Corruption' called 'Favor', I can sense it.\nThese countless worlds, countless battles, countless... deaths.\"": 212,
          "\"Is this... the future?\nMessenger, where are you in the timeline...?\"": 213,
          "\"Ah... it's... pitch black...\"": 214,
          "\"Ah... is this... light...?\"": 215,
          "\"Messenger... please, kill me once.\"": 216,
          "\"I trust you will be able to find the truth.\"": 217,
          "Withered Vessel": 218,
          "Brave*1": 219,
          "Duelist*1": 220,
          "Crimson Dragon*1": 221,
          "Blood Snail*1": 222,
          "Llawenydd ": 223,
          "\"I've grown tired of seeing those eyes...\nThose of fools who believe they can defeat me, they who are full of\narrogance and excitement...\"": 224,
          "\"The ones who loudly proclaimed themselves swordsmen or righteous\nthieves, all of them...they all got crushed to pieces...!\nAh, my body, it aches...soon, you'll be just the same, won't you?\"": 225,
          "\"Haha...a death-seeking madman, is what you are.\"": 226,
          "\"Ahaha...\nFighting you reminds me of Arkos...\n...You probably don't know, do you?\nThat hero, dead for a long time...\"": 227,
          "\"Ah, to think I'd end up with such prey in the end...\nWhat an opportunity, what joy...!!\n...Haha. I remember those days of glorious reign...\"": 228,
          "\"Well done, you've gotten much stronger, Raid...\nOnce only brandishing reckless bravery...\nYou've truly become a formidable foe, haven't you?": 229,
          "\"You might reach me... with that blade of yours...\nPerhaps you could even kill me...\nAhahahaha...\"": 230,
          "\"─I'll kill you.\"": 231,
          "\\c[10]\\{\"You will never find hope ever again!!\nWrath! Fear!!\nI'll carve an everlasting despair into your soul!!!": 232,
          "My body is grabbed by the giant dragon's hand...\n\n\\c[2]You can no longer defend yourself.": 233,
          "Last Wish*1": 234,
          "Knight*1": 235,
          "Last Wish*2": 236,
          "Corpse*3": 237,
          "Tombstone*1": 238,
          "Blacksmiths' Grudge": 239,
          "\\c[2]My weapon's shaking like crazy...\n\n\\c[10]Weapon swapping is no longer possible.": 240,
          "\\c[2]The weapon in my hand suddenly begins to shake...\n\n\\c[10]The weapon is violently shaking...\nWeapon swapping will probably be impossible...": 241,
          "\\c[10]Drop your weapon.": 242,
          "\\c[10]Continue using it. (ATK & MAG -50%)": 243,
          "Anfarwol": 244,
          "NW名前指定 Eye Hunter Rau": 245,
          "\"Well, well, daughter of Wrath...\nLooks like you're doing just fine, huh?\"": 246,
          "\"I've never seen such filthy eyes before...\nAfter I gouge them out, I'll crush them into mush...\"": 247,
          "\"...What are you resisting for?\nWith the world ending, why beg for life?\"": 248,
          "\"...Foolish.\"": 249,
          "\"How pathetic, the cycle of life...\"": 250,
          "Hero's Remains": 251,
          "Corpse Eater*2": 252,
          "Raid Event": 253,
          "Carchar Hela": 254,
          "Corpse Devourer*2": 255,
          "Corpse Devourer*3": 256,
          "Follower*3": 257,
          "Follower*4": 258,
          "Elder Dragonkin 1": 259,
          "Elder Dragonkin 2": 260,
          "Faded One": 261,
          "Syvthiedy": 262,
          "NW名前指定 Syvthiedy": 263,
          "\"Ah... this feels so good...♪\n\nHey... I really enjoy being with you...♪\"": 264,
          "\"I'm sorry for thinking about killing you so quickly♪\nWill you forgive me...? Will you forgive me?\n...Hehe♪ Now we're friends, right~♪\"": 265,
          "\"We're friends, right?\"": 266,
          "\"─Kyahaha!\"": 267,
          "\"Hey, let's play some more, okay?♪\"": 268,
          "\"Ahh~~...♡\nHey, I like... I like, like... like, like...♡♡\nI've fallen in love with you...♡  I can't hold it back anymore...♡\nIs that okay, is that okay... ufufu...♡\"": 269,
          "\"Please...♡ Accept all of me...♡\"": 270,
          "\"Haa...♡ That was so much fun...♡\"": 271,
          "\"Ufufu...♡ Let's play again, okay...♡\"": 272,
          "\"Ah, you're really strong...♡\"": 273,
          "\"I've never been overwhelmed like this before.\nHah, it's so exciting...♡\"": 274,
          "\"...Hey, will you come and meet me again...?\"": 275,
          "Spreader of Plague*1": 276,
          "Dial": 277,
          "\"For the hope of everyone, for the sword!!\"": 278,
          "\\^": 279,
          "\"This is... Wrath...!\"": 280,
          "\"We've come full circle, time to finish this...!!\"": 281,
          "\"The reason I've lived this long...\nIs to kill Wrath and end this madness...\"": 282,
          "\"...\\n[1]. \\!\nThank you. For staying with me all this time.\"": 283,
          "\"...\\n[1].\\!\nThank you. For staying with me all this time.\"": 284,
          "Wrath that dwells within...": 285,
          "This deep resentment of life...": 286,
          "All of this was spawned by it...": 287,
          "The Canaanite sin...": 288,
          "With destruction...": 289,
          "We all must redeem it...": 290,
          "\"If life's a sin, then what should we call yours?\"\n": 291,
          "Far beyond, much more wicked, no...?": 292,
          "\"...!\nYour life and ours can never be comparable to a sin!\nThe calamity you create is one and only true sin...!\"": 293,
          "Karna ": 294,
          "\"Ah, dear sister...!\nWhat you and the others told me was right!\nI'm truly the embodiment of miracles!\nSo use my body, please, and restore the miracles to this world...!\"": 295,
          "\"Look, mother, I'll fly through the sky!!!\nI'll clear all the regrets you had, all of them!!!\nEven though the people from the other countries gave us cold looks,\nI'll make sure to put smiles on their faces!!!\"": 296,
          "\"I'll make sure those who broke your smile regret what they did...\nAhh, can you watch over me from the other side...? Mother...\"": 297,
          "Remains of a Failure": 298,
          "Something from the Snow Country": 299,
          "Shadow of the Miracle": 300,
          "Corrupted Knight": 301,
          "Sword of Dreams, Arkos": 302,
          "\"This is the light I forged from everyone's dreams!!\"": 303,
          "\"YOU!!!\nLet's see if you're worthy of inheriting it!!\"": 304,
          "\"Yes...!! You, stay strong...!!\nShow me, with your own hands, that you can carve through the Wrath!\n\n─Let's do this!! Don't let your guard down until the end...!!\"": 305,
          "\"...You're worthy.\"": 306,
          "Risu (Normal)": 307,
          "\"Nee, Fetus. Are you crying?\nWeren't we so close?\nThen I wonder why has it turned out like this...?\"": 308,
          "\"Of course we were close, up until this point...!!\n\\n[1]... We've always fought together.\nWe've always met our journey's end facing her!\"": 309,
          "\"─We'll end everything right here!! Risu!!\"": 310,
          "\"End everything, you say? Isn't that a bit too rash...\"": 311,
          "\"Let's finish this quickly, shall we?\"": 312,
          "Risu (Final)": 313,
          "NW名前指定 Risu, Pale Eternity": 314,
          "\"And now, goodbye.\"": 315,
          "Raid1": 316,
          "Who...??????? WHO...????????? Who... are... you???????\nWhose... whose face... who's face...??? You...?\nWho??? WHO? Why... WHY... take it...???? Take it...???\nYou? You... take... take it... from me????": 317,
          "Give... give it back... BACK, it's MINE, it's MINE!!!\nWhere? WHERE is it? Where it go...? WHERE you hide it???\nWhere... WHERE did it disappear??? It's gone... GONE... lost...\nYou... YOU hid it... hid my... my... FACE... MY IDENTITY!!!!": 318,
          "Damned? Don't look at me with my eyes, with my face, with my body.\nGive it back, return it... my... my name, my body, my form, my...\nReturn it, return it, my... what's left of me! return it!\nYou! Did you take it?? Did you steal it??? From me. FROM MEEE!!!!!": 319,
          "\\{\\{\\{\\{\\{\\{\\{Why\\}\\}\\}\\}\\}its\\{\\{you??\\{\\{\\{?\\}\\}\\}\\}?\\{\\{?\\}\\}\\}?????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????\\}\\}\\}\\}\\}\\}": 320,
          "\\{\\{\\{\\{\\{Give\\{\\{i\\}\\}\\}\\}t\\{t\\}\\}ba\\{c\\}\\}k!\\{・・‥・・...・・・‥・・・...‥・": 321,
          "Raid2": 322,
          "OPEN OPEN it opened I I'm the one who OPENED it with MY hands life\nlife EYES were taken by HIS eyes opened With MY hands scratching\nscratching cutting killing cutting opened chaos I TOOK with my hands\nstolen eyes HATE HATE with justice kill that form form form of ME!!!": 323,
          "That eye eye opened I I am the form, form of justice justice is\nDEATH IS RETRIBUTION... By death, my eyes eyes I eyes I eyes soul me\ntook my form, my form stolen AHAHAHAAAAAAAAAA DAMNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNN\nMELTING BURNING BURNING BURNING SHATTERING SPLITTING BREAKING!!!!": 324,
          "\\{\\{\\{\\{\\{ Ku \\}\\}\\}\\} Ku \\{\\{\\{\\{ and do \\}\\}\\} and \\{\\{\\{─": 325,
          "Raid3": 326,
          "Blood-stained land... blood-stained world...\nPain... sadness... suffering... screaming... voices... nowhere...\nLaughter swallowed... by sacrifice hoarse whispers... unforgiving...\nEverything... certain... shattered... CRUSHED...": 327,
          "I’ll break it all... SHATTER it all... CRUSH it all... BLOOD...\nThe sacrifice... an eternal evil... dream yes... yes! I’ll BREAK...\nEverything... BREAK it all... pluck this... rotten land...\nSoaked deep... in its SIN...": 328,
          "...My justice... my justice... MY justice... MY justice...\nIt’s MY form... my form... my form... form... FORM...\nWhy... MY form??? WHY? Why? YOU... YOU! You have MY form???\nAGGGGGGGGH DON'T LOOOOK AT MEEEEEEEEEEEEEE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!": 329,
          "Haha, ha....\nYou...─　Do you,....　...\n　Do you　‥　・　　see it・‥　　too　...　‥　‥　・　‥　?\n　　　　　　　　　─　　　　─　　‥　　─　　...　　──": 330,
          "Raid4": 331,
          "How much of life has vanished?\nHow much of the dream was scratched away, erased?\nHow much of love was loved, loved, loved, trampled and erased?...": 332,
          "I see everything. Watching. Still laughing with those eyes,\nthose eyes... what...are they? They're empty, observing from\nsomewhere, like those two eyes...watching...": 333,
          "What is that? What is it...?\"": 334,
          "──‥ ... ·──‥ ...": 335,
          "─...‥‥?\"": 336,
          "Do you... really not understand anything...?\n...Hahaha.\nWell then, you... I'll tell you...": 337,
          "Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes\nEyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes Eyes": 338,
          "Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us\nOur us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us Our us": 339,
          "Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside\nInside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside Inside": 340,
          "Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists\nExists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists Exists": 341,
          "Hahahahaha...\nHahahaha...": 342,
          "HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA...": 343,
          "Lord of Wrath, Dial (Fetus)": 344,
          "\"I won't accept such a meaningless end.\nFor that, I... crossed time,\nand chased you all the way here.\"": 345,
          " \"Finally, the time has come\nfor my blade to reach you...!!\"": 346,
          "\\c[18]You are powerless against me...": 347,
          "\"We can do it... together.\"": 348,
          "\"Let's go, partner...\nLet's fulfill our mission—.\"": 349,
          "\\c[18]You idiots...!!": 350,
          "\\c[18]Ah, fading...!!\nMy body, it's crumbling once again!!": 351,
          "\\c[18]I will not die...!!!\nThis alone... won't be enough to kill me...!!": 352,
          "\\c[18]I cannot understand...!": 353,
          "\\c[18]I can't possibly understand...!!": 354,
          "\\c[18]Why resist? Why resist such a painless death...!!": 355,
          "\\c[18]Submit...!!\nEmbrace a peaceful end...!!!": 356,
          "\"I'll never surrender to something like that !!\nNo matter how doomed it seems,\nI'll never give up on this world!!\"": 357,
          "\"We believe in the light within ourselves, and move\nthrough the darkness...\nSo long as the flame in our hearts doesn't fade,\nthere'll never be an end for us!!\"": 358,
          "Dial (Final Battle)": 359,
          "\\c[18]Your time has run out...": 360,
          "\\c[18]You cannot stop the inevitable...": 361,
          "\\c[18]Everything is about to end...": 362,
          "\\c[18]A long, long... nightmare... is now coming to an end...": 363,
          "\\c[18]The dream... the world... all life...": 364,
          "\\c[18]They all have led the world to its end...": 365,
          "\\c[2]My body... it won't move...": 366,
          "Final battle": 367,
          "マップ名非表示処理いれてるから考慮しといてね！": 368,
          "\\c[1]\"\\n[1]It's okay. With our power...\nNo matter how many times you fall,\nwe'll make sure you can stand once more, again, again and again...!\"": 369,
          "\\c[4]\"From the moment I sent you out as a messenger...\nI have always wanted to share my power with you...\nNow... is the time... please, accept it...\"": 370,
          "\\c[8]\"You made a promise to me... didn't you?\nSo please... rise.\"": 371,
          "\\c[29]\"I'm really grateful you set me free...\nI couldn't thank you then, but... I want to thank you now!\"": 372,
          "\\c[27]\"Messenger, you shall become the leader of the new age.\n...I'm counting on you. For this world's future.\"": 373,
          "\\c[31]\"...Both Maruoris-sama and I...\nWe truly thought we couldn't go on anymore, you know...?\nPlease, for all of us... for everyone's dream...!\"": 374,
          "\\c[29]\"...I beg, don't forget that we're all here...\nPlease, carry on our loyalty... our justice... our dreams...\"": 375,
          "The moment my body collapses...\nThe souls within brightly shine.": 376,
          "\\c[18]Endless rage... endless hatred...": 377,
          "\\c[18]Unrelenting, burning Wrath...": 378,
          "\\c[18]...Ah.": 379,
          "\\c[18]Everything flows away...": 380,
          "\\c[18]All the glory...": 381,
          "\\c[18]Gone to ruin...": 382,
          "\\c[18]Future ahead...": 383,
          "\\c[18]Gone... Forever...": 384,
          "\\c[18]It no longer exists...": 385,
          "\\c[7]Is this...": 386,
          "\\c[7]The end?": 387,
          "\\c[7]Ah...": 388,
          "\\c[7]How...": 389,
          "\\c[7]Comforting...": 390,
          "Lord of Wrath, Dial (End)": 391,
          "\\c[18]You...": 392,
          "\\c[18]What meaning is there in resisting...": 393,
          "\\c[18]Soon, everything will end...": 394,
          "\\c[18]Pitiful messenger...": 395,
          "\\c[18]Accept your fate, and disappear with the world...": 396,
          "\\c[18]I will not die...": 397,
          "\\c[18]Even if you try to strike me down, nothing will change...": 398,
          "\\c[18]...Surrender, and die, if you must.": 399,
          "\\c[18]The Wrath that dwells within...": 400,
          "\\c[18]Will vanish with life itself...": 401,
          "\\c[18]Everyone, and everything...": 402,
          "Dokugamori*​2": 403,
          "Dia-Dale": 404,
          "NW名前指定 Eye Hunter Dia-Dale": 405,
          "\"I... know everything...\nThat's why. That's why there's no need to be afraid...\nI want you to trust me...\"": 406,
          "\"Your body... your eyes... give them to me...!!\"": 407,
          "\"─Ahhahahaha!!!\nHow unfortunate, Karna...!!!\"": 408,
          "\"Gwirionedd's messenger... I'll give it to you...\"": 409,
          "\"All of my rebellion...!!\"": 410,
          "Quisgu": 411,
          "NW名前指定 Quisgu the Keeper": 412,
          "\"...Its been quite a while since I've had a guest.\nWhat is it that brings you all the way here to me?\"": 413,
          "Read a Forbidden Tome": 414,
          "\\c[18]Kill": 415,
          "Leave": 416,
          "『Truth』": 417,
          "『The End』": 418,
          "『Future』": 419,
          "Return": 420,
          "\"Truth... ah, the truth you wish to read isn't about Koff.\\!\nThe Eye Of Truth, Gwirionedd.\nPeople looked and looked for it, that is, the source of the world,\nand only Gwirionedd, from stars above, was one to arrive at it.\"": 421,
          "\"In doing so, she became a star, becoming the Eye of Truth.\nThere's nothing more and nothing less to it than that.\"": 422,
          "\"The End. Finish. Epilogue. Certainly many variants it seems.\nBut, in a story without you, there seems only one definite 'End.'\"": 423,
          "\"...Or it should be so, anyway.\nNevertheless, within me, your existence isn't recorded.\nNo, more succinctly, your 'existence' certainly exists,\nbut I do not know which one of the 'you' you are, of now.\"": 424,
          "\"Perhaps it seems you...\nyou have well strayed from the laws of this world.\"": 425,
          "\"…The future, huh. There seems far too many.\nYet throughout, there is one stringent commonality.\nA point of convergence. I see in none anything pleasant,\nand I see in none a concluding respite.\"": 426,
          "\"…Though of course, that may well be fine.\"": 427,
          "\"Should you be able to strike me down...\nI shall give you the clear truth...\"": 428,
          "\"An irresistible power, no doubt.\nDeath itself made corporeal...\nKoff, the force that represents her...\"": 429,
          "\"She has now become one with the world...\nShe truly is the truth of the world.\nThe 'veritas' everyone sought...\nthe 'Eye of Truth', nothing but an illusion...\"": 430,
          "\"With death, your souls will turn.\nThere exists none more truthful than Koff, nothing beyond her.\nTherefore, in hunting an illusory truth... the world falls,\nand so, all will all likewise sink, with the dreams of Wrath.\"": 431,
          "\"…And, you know, that's fine.\"": 432,
          "\"So goes the fate of the world ruled by illusion,\none Koff herself desired.\n...In such a world where truth is erased, fiction becomes truth.\"": 433,
          "\"─I therefore shall ask.\nO Messenger from the dream of Gwirionedd.\"": 434,
          "\"If it were you— how would you kill death?\"": 435,
          "Spiritual Beast": 436,
          "Creation": 437,
          "\\c[10]An intense heat is generated by the Wrath's attacks.\n\n\\c[18]During this battle, the damage received by both sides increases.": 438,
          "Elcis": 439,
          "\"Hey, hey, where's the woman that was here before?\nIf you know, tell me where she is.\nI'll go get her eyeball for you, alright?\"": 440,
          "NW名前指定 Golden Knight Elcis": 441,
          "\"...\"": 442,
          "\"Ah, sister...\nI... I've been so useless, right to the very end...\"": 443,
          "\"Alright, you! Gouge out the eye!!\"": 444,
          "\"You... why...\"": 445,
          "\"Hmm... I really didn't want to use this...\"": 446,
          "\"Forgive me, sister...\nIt seems I have no choice but to use the power of the golden sword!\"": 447,
          "\\c[14]A fierce thunder erupts from Elcis' sword...": 448,
          "\"...Huh?\nHey, hey, was that it?\nHa-ha, well, guess I'll just take it then!\"": 449,
          "Rau (Kill/Mercant's House)": 450,
          "\"Hah... what a disappointment...\nFigured we could have a nice relationship,\nbut to think you'd try to interfere with the hunt...\nIt's so sad. Just so sad...\"": 451,
          "\"...Hmm. Hmm, no complaints.\nI'll free you from eye hunting...\"": 452,
          "\"─Call me Elcis!!\nHero of Gold who defeated the leader of the demons,\nI am he who inherits the power of the gold sword!\"": 453,
          "Rau (Kill/Martydom)": 454,
          "\"Not sure what you didn't like about this, but fine...\nYou're in for a bad time.\"": 455,
          "Rifell": 456,
          "\"The Eye... that Eye, it's because of your Eyes...\nYour Eyes are what drove me to insanity...!\"": 457,
          "\"...Rau.\nIs there any way we can go back, even just a little?\"": 458,
          "\"I don't know...\nI've already reached the point where\nI've no choice but to end it...\"": 459,
          "\"Damn it, please, seriously...\nJust die quietly...！！\"": 460,
          "\"Rau, what do you think...\nWas your big sister strong...?\"": 461,
          "\"I couldn't compete at all.\nNot with Arkos-sama, nor with any of you guys...\"": 462,
          "\"...\nRau... please...\nJust a little... at the end...\"": 463,
          "\"...Ah.\"": 464,
          "\"...Rau, you're still... so warm...\"": 465,
          "Rau (Hallard)": 466,
          "\"What do I look like to you...?\"": 467,
          "An Eye Hunter": 468,
          "Not an Eye Hunter": 469,
          "\"...Hehe. Is that so, is that so?\nI don't know why, but even though I should hate it...\nHearing it from you. Hey, it doesn't feel so bad...\"": 470,
          "\"...Oh, right.\nLet's talk about who'll be our next prey, alright?\"": 471,
          "\"You can tell just by looking into my eyes, can't you?\n\n─Ahahah!\nLet's fall together... all the way to the bottom!\"": 472,
          "NW名前指定 Rau": 473,
          "\"...I see.\nSo, that's how you've seen me all this time...\"": 474,
          "\"Then... could you save me?\nNot the Eye Hunter me, but...\nThe Rau-chan, always sobbing deep inside,\njust a normal human girl. The ordinary me...\"": 475,
          "\"What do you think my dream was...?\nTo be able to receivethe  love of \\n[1],\nTo be \\n[1]'s lover... and then...\nTo spend the same time together with \\n[1].\"": 476,
          "\"I was seriously thinking that...\n'I want to become \\n[1]'s wife.'\nYeah, really, I was thinking that...\nnot like that's ever gonna come true now... ahaha...\"": 477,
          "\"─Sorry.\nI just... I can't keep it together anymore...\"": 478,
          "\"...Hehehe.\nReally, you're strong...\"": 479,
          "\"──.\"": 480,
          "\"...Truth is,\nI wish I could've done this from the very beginning...\"": 481,
          "\"...\\n[1].\nYou... you've been my savior until the very end...\n...That really makes me very happy.\"": 482,
          "\"...It was just a little before I met you, I think.\"": 483,
          "\"I started hearing a voice inside me... said it would guide me...\nSo, I let myself be led, and... this is where it got me...\nYou must be thinking I'm pretty stupid, huh...?\"": 484,
          "\"I know I wasn't supposed to carve it... something so precious...\nThanks to that... I managed to retain small shards of my sanity...\nBut you know, the eye hunting...\nKilled even those precious few wavering embers...\"": 485,
          "\"…Hey. So, here now, I've got a favor to ask.\nIf somehow… If there's ever a chance I return...\nMake sure you put a stop to it.\nSmash my body, destroy it completely, mutilate it entirely...\"": 486,
          "\"If I do come back, If these eyes return once more,\nI... won't be myself…\"": 487,
          "\"...Sorry. I'm sorry.\nI even tried to kill you...\nI'm praying that, from here on out, you'll live a happy life...\nFor you to have a happy end as well...\"": 488,
          "\"...I've made it this far because you saved me, \\n[1]...\nIf you hadn't come, I'd be rotting away inside that monster now.\"": 489,
          "\"...I really want to repay my debt... but sadly, I'm just pathetic.\nThat thing inside my head... it crawled through my mind...\nDestroyed everything I held dear... spared nothing at all...\"": 490,
          "\"Heh… that thing,\nIt's now moving further and further away from me at least...\nServes it right…\"": 491,
          "\"Hey, \\n[1]...\nIf I die... make sure, really make sure, I never... ever come back.\nCrush my body to thousands of pieces so I never return...\"": 492,
          "\"If those eyes come back, I don't think I'd be able to stop myself.\nSo please, I'm begging you. Don't hold back...\"": 493,
          "\"...\nOne last thing...\nCould you... hold me... just this once...?\"": 494,
          "Hug her": 495,
          "I won't hug you": 496,
          "\"...Ah.\"\n": 497,
          "\"My prince...\"": 498,
          "\"You're right...\nWhat if my left hand slips...?\nIt might just move on its own... mistakes happen, hehehe...”": 499,
          "\"As expected of my prince...\"": 500,
          "Test": 501,
          "Beast of the Stars": 502
        },
